{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_SskEGGiiqadoV1szt5r18404","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"text\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Sparse-Linear Attention (SLA).md\",\"matches\":[{\"context\":\"每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSLA是Zhang et al. (2025, Tsinghua & UC Berkeley) 提出的可训练混合注意力机制，融合稀疏和线性注意力来加速DiT模型。核心洞察：注意力权重可分解为P = (P⊙M) + (P⊙(1-M))，前者（~8%）高rank需O(N²)，后者（~92%）极低rank可用线性注意力。SLA通过压缩mask预测将注意力块分三\",\"match\":{\"start\":153,\"end\":156}},{\"context\":\"7.91T) 和Linear Only (VA=0.042, 0.10T)。\\n\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\\n代码：https://github.com/thu-ml/SLA。单fused CUDA kernel实现前向+反向。使用流程：加载DiT → 替换注意力层 → fine-tune 2000步 → SLA kernel推理。推荐超参数：k_h=5%, b_q=b_{kv}=64, φ=softmax。\",\"match\":{\"start\":1206,\"end\":1212}},{\"context\":\"VA=0.042, 0.10T)。\\n\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\\n代码：https://github.com/thu-ml/SLA。单fused CUDA kernel实现前向+反向。使用流程：加载DiT → 替换注意力层 → fine-tune 2000步 → SLA kernel推理。推荐超参数：k_h=5%, b_q=b_{kv}=64, φ=softmax。RTX 5090上：13.7× ke\",\"match\":{\"start\":1227,\"end\":1230}},{\"context\":\"https://github.com/thu-ml/SLA。单fused CUDA kernel实现前向+反向。使用流程：加载DiT → 替换注意力层 → fine-tune 2000步 → SLA kernel推理。推荐超参数：k_h=5%, b_q=b_{kv}=64, φ=softmax。RTX 5090上：13.7× kernel加速 vs FlashAttention2，2.2×端到端加速（Wan2\",\"match\":{\"start\":1264,\"end\":1270}},{\"context\":\"iT → 替换注意力层 → fine-tune 2000步 → SLA kernel推理。推荐超参数：k_h=5%, b_q=b_{kv}=64, φ=softmax。RTX 5090上：13.7× kernel加速 vs FlashAttention2，2.2×端到端加速（Wan2.1-1.3B视频生成）。额外效率优化：Lookup table（sparsity>90%）、Pre-aggregation（减\",\"match\":{\"start\":1328,\"end\":1334}},{\"context\":\"e（sparsity>90%）、Pre-aggregation（减法替代加法）、Method of Four Russians。\\n\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- SLA: Beyond Sparsity in Diffusion Transformers via Fine-Tunable Sparse-Linear Attention\\n\",\"match\":{\"start\":1501,\"end\":1510}},{\"context\":\">90%）、Pre-aggregation（减法替代加法）、Method of Four Russians。\\n\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- SLA: Beyond Sparsity in Diffusion Transformers via Fine-Tunable Sparse-Linear Attention\\n\",\"match\":{\"start\":1511,\"end\":1522}}]},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Method of Four Russians (in SLA GPU Kernel Context).md\",\"matches\":[{\"context\":\"Method of Four Russians (in SLA GPU Kernel Context)\",\"match\":{\"start\":36,\"end\":42}},{\"context\":\"## Method of Four Russians (in SLA GPU Kernel Context)\\n\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMethod of Four Russians (Arlazarov et al., 19\",\"match\":{\"start\":39,\"end\":45}},{\"context\":\"既不太小也不太大（~50%）时，将连续的g个h_j和z_j分组，预计算每组内所有2^g种可能的子集和存入查找表，前向/反向时任何子集的聚合结果通过单次查表获取，而非on-the-fly逐个求和。\\n\\n从kernel调度角度拆解：\\n```\\nStandard marginal block aggregation (line 13 in Algorithm 1):\\n  for each Q block i:\\n    \",\"match\":{\"start\":356,\"end\":362}},{\"context\":\"r each Q block i:\\n      H_i = 0\\n      for j where M_c[i,j]==0:\\n          H_i += h_j    // one d×d addition per marginal block\\n  // Cost: (#marginal_blocks) × (d×d addition)\\n\\nMethod of Four Russians optim\",\"match\":{\"start\":540,\"end\":543}},{\"context\":\"        H_i += h_j    // one d×d addition per marginal block\\n  // Cost: (#marginal_blocks) × (d×d addition)\\n\\nMethod of Four Russians optimization:\\n  // Offline/precompute: group h_j into segments of g co\",\"match\":{\"start\":605,\"end\":608}},{\"context\":\"k != 0:  // not all negligible/critical\\n              H_i += LUT_s[bitmask]    // single lookup + addition\\n  // Cost: (#segments) × (one lookup + one addition)\\n  // Theoretical reduction: 1/g\\n```\\n\\n适用条件：m\",\"match\":{\"start\":1155,\"end\":1158}},{\"context\":\"  H_i += LUT_s[bitmask]    // single lookup + addition\\n  // Cost: (#segments) × (one lookup + one addition)\\n  // Theoretical reduction: 1/g\\n```\\n\\n适用条件：marginal块比例~50%时最优。sparsity极高（>90%）时用Pre-aggregation更\",\"match\":{\"start\":1207,\"end\":1210}},{\"context\":\" marginal块），Method of Four Russians作为备选优化。\\n\\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\\n经典实现用于布尔矩阵乘法和transitive closure。在SLA的GPU kernel中：预计算的lookup table存储在GPU global memory或sh