nel.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 4149): mega-kernel tGraph、SM 级 event-driven 调度、BFS linearization","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block Order Scheduling _ L2 Cache Reuse (GPU).md` (score: 32.7): persistent grid + block order 对 L2 reuse 的显著影响"," ","-CUTLASS 将 GEMM 计算分解为严格的层次化 tile 结构，从最细到最粗粒度依次为：","+### S3: GPU SM warp scheduler 驱动 tile 级并发","+- `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 2891): warp scheduler 切换隐藏延迟、occupancy 与 register/SMEM 零和博弈","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wave Specialization (Producer-Consumer) on AMD.md`: NVIDIA GPU 上 TMA+wgmma+mbarrier 实现 producer-consumer overlap"," ","-```","-层次化 Tile 分解（自上而下）:","-┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│ Device 级: Grid = (M/M_tile, N/N_tile) 个 CTA       │","-│ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │","-│ │ Thread Block (CTA) 级: M_tile × N_tile           │ │","-│ │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │ │","-│ │ │ Warp 级: WarpShape (如 64×64), 每 warp 32 线程│ │ │","-│ │ │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐ │ │ │","-│ │ │ │ Thread 级: MMA fragment (如 16×16×16)    │ │ │ │","-│ │ │ │ Tensor Core 单指令处理一个 fragment       │ │ │ │","-│ │ │ └────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │ │","-│ │ └────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │","-│ └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │","-└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+### S4: NPU 达芬奇架构 tile 约束","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910 AI Accelerator（昇腾910 AI加速器）.md`: Cube/Vector/Scalar Unit 三单元分离架构、粗粒度 Tile-based 区别于 SIMT","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Huawei Ascend 910B3 NPU.md`: 910B3 20 AI Cores、多级 on-chip buffer"," ","-**MMA Tile 形状与精度对应**（可推断 + 笔记证据）:","+### S5: TPU MXU 128×128/128×256 systolic array tile 限制","+- 该链条节点无 note evidence"," ","-| 精度 | MMA 指令形状 (M×N×K) | Tensor Core 代数 | 适用架构 |","-|------|----------------------|-------------------|----------|","-| FP16 | 16×16×16 | Volta/Turing | V100, T4 |","-| FP16 | 16×8×16 | Ampere | A100 |","-| TF32 | 16×8×8 | Ampere | A100 |","-| FP8 | 16×16×32 | Hopper (4th gen) | H100 |","-| INT8 | 32×16×16 | Turing+ | T4, A100, H100 |","+### S6-S9: MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 模型 kernel tiling","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md` (score: 41.5): MoE expert FFN fused kernel、Triton 伪代码","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused Sparse-Linear Attention GPU Kernel.md`: SLA fused kernel for DiT attention","+- `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Open-Sora (DiT-based Video Generation Framework).md`: Video DiT 算子序列"," ","-**注解**: CUTLASS 的 tile 层次设计直接映射到 GPU SM 微架构的物理资源层级：MMA fragment 映射到 Tensor Core 的一次矩阵乘加操作（每个 warp 在一个 cycle 内提交一条 `mma.sync` 指令）；Warp Tile 对应一个 warp 在 shared memory 中持有的数据窗口（数据复用窗口大小 = 计算量 / 访存量）；Thread Block Tile 通过 shared memory 实现 block 内所有 warp 间的数据共享；Grid 将整个输出矩阵按 tile 划分到各 SM 上并行执行。CUTLASS 3.x 的 CuTe 库提供多维线程/数据布局抽象，使得 tile 迭代器（TileIterator）和 Collective 可以实现 warp-specialized 数据流水线（producer warp 通过 TMA 加载、consumer warp 执行 MMA）。","-"," ---"," ","-### 1.2 FlashMoE Persistent Kernel 的 Tile 设计与 SM 映射","+## 一、GPU Tile 切分策略与硬件对齐机制（主内容）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 4211.2)；`paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1347.6)","+### 1.1 Tile Size/Shape 选择：WELDER 硬件感知的三级 Penalty 搜索"," ","-FlashMoE 是首个将分布式 MoE 全部操作融合为单一 persistent kernel 的工作。其 tile 维度和 SM 映射策略如下：","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` (score: 3808)"," ","+WELDER 在 SubGraphTiling 中通过三级硬件感知 penalty 驱动 tile shape 搜索，使 tile 配置天然匹配 GPU 物理约束：","+"," ```","-FlashMoE tile 配置（通过 parameter sweep 确定）:","-┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│ tile 维度:     (128, 64)                     │","-│ block_size:    128 threads/block             │","-│ registers:     255/thread (max, 0 spill)     │","-│ SMEM:          46 KB/block                   │","-│ blocks/SM:     max 2 (受限于 register/SMEM)   │","-│ Grid:          N blocks/GPU                  │","-│                                               │","-│ 角色分配:                                      │","-│   blockId < N-1:  Processor (执行 GEMM 计算)   │","-│   blockId = N-1:   OS block                   │","-│     warp 0:        Scheduler (任务调度)        │","-│     warp 1-3:      Subscriber (解码远程 tile)  │","-└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-```","+// WELDER EnumerateSubtiles（V100 参数）","+EnumerateSubtiles(graph, last_config):","+  init_tile = {axis: 1 for axis in output_axes}"," ","-**tile 维度选择的关键洞察**（笔记原文总结）：","-1. 增大 tile width（N 维）会显著提高每线程 register 使用量，触发 register spill 到 local memory（性能灾难）","-2. 增大 tile height（M 维）但不增加线程数，使每线程工作量增加，降低并行度","-3. 增加 block 线程数 > 128 会减少每 SM 并发 block 数，降低 SM occupancy","-4. 更大 block size 增加 `__syncthreads()` barrier 开销","+  for axis in output_axes:","+    tile = init_tile.copy()","+    while tile[axis] < tensor_dim[axis]:","+      tile[axis] = expand_toward_hardware_alignment(tile[axis])"," ","-**注解**: tile 维度 (128, 64) 是 FlashMoE 在 A100/H100 上经 exhaustive parameter sweep 后的最优解。M=128 沿 token batch 维度切分，N=64 沿 FFN intermediate 维度切分。该配置在 register 使用（255 寄存器/线程接近 A100 的 256KB/SM 上限）和 SM occupancy（2 blocks/SM）间取得平衡。每个 Processor block 内部使用 CUTLASS device-side API 执行 fused GEMM0 (A×W₁→GELU→+bias) + GEMM1 (C₁×W₂→identity)，消除了退出 kernel 和重新 launch 的开销。","+      // Penalty 1: Uncoalesced Memory Access","+      // V100 L1 cache line = 128B = 32×FP32 elements/transaction","+      if not is_coalesced(tile, transaction_width=128B):","+        extra_traffic = calculate_extra_transactions(tile)","+        // tile 的 leading dim 不整除 32 → 非合并访问 → 额外 memory transaction"," ","----","+      // Penalty 2: Parallelism Underutilization","+      // V100: 80 SMs × 4 warp schedulers → 至少 128 并行 tile","+      num_parallel_tiles = total_elements / tile_size","+      if num_parallel_tiles < MIN_PARALLELISM(128):","+        extra_traffic *= (MIN_PARALLELISM / num_parallel_tiles)","+        // tile 过大 → SM 吃不饱 → 实际利用率按比例下降"," ","-### 1.3 FlashAttention Tiling Scheme：SRAM-Bounded Tile Size 推导","+      // Penalty 3: Capacity Overflow","+      footprint = MemFootprint(graph_with_tile_config)","+      if footprint > target_memory_capacity:","+        continue  // infinite penalty → 直接淘汰此 tile shape"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md`","+      // MMA Tensor Core 整除约束","+      for axis marked as MMA_axis:","+        enforce tile[axis] % MMA_FRAGMENT_SIZE(16, FP16) == 0","+        // M、N、K 必须整除 16 才能映射到完整的 mma.m16n8k16 指令"," ","-FlashAttention 是 tiling 策略在 attention kernel 中的经典应用。其 tile size 选择由 SRAM 容量直接决定：","+      adjusted_traffic = MemTraffic(graph) + extra_traffic","+      configs.push(tile_config, priority=adjusted_traffic)"," ","+  return configs  // sorted by adjusted_traffic ascending"," ```","-FlashAttention tile 分块参数（A100, d=64, FP16, M=192KB SRAM）:"," ","-B_c = ⌈M / (4d)⌉ = ⌈192×1024 / (4×64×2)⌉ ≈ 384   (KV block size, 沿序列维度)","-B_r = min(B_c, d) = min(384, 64) = 64               (Q block size, 沿序列维度)","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `tile[axis]` = 某维度 tile size；`HARDWARE_PARALLELISM` = 80 SMs × warp slot 下限（V100）；`MMA_FRAGMENT_SIZE` = 16（FP16 Tensor Core `mma.m16n8k16` 的 M/N/K 对齐粒度）","+- **复杂度**: 枚举空间 = 各维度 tile size 的笛卡尔积；三个 penalty 各自 O(1) 计算，可并行评估多候选","+- **数据依赖**: Penalty 1 依赖 leading dimension（tile 的最内维的 stride）与 128B transaction 的对齐关系；Penalty 2 依赖 tile count vs SM count 的比例；Penalty 3 直接依赖 SMEM footprint","+- **并发可行性**: 多 tile shape 候选可并行评估（penalty 计算无数据依赖）"," ","-每 block pair (i,j) 的 SRAM 分配:","-  K_j tile:  B_c × d × 2B = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB","-  V_j tile:  B_c × d × 2B = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB","-  Q_i tile:  B_r × d × 2B = 64  × 64 × 2 =  8,192 B ≈  8 KB","-  S_ij/P_ij: B_r × B_c × 2B = 64 × 384 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB","-  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","-  Total: 49+49+8+49 = 155 KB ≤ 192 KB SRAM ✓","-```","+### 1.2 Warp Tile → MMA Tile → CTA Tile 的层次化映射"," ","-**HBM 访问量对比**（forward pass, N=1024, d=64）:","-- Standard attention: ~8.5 MB（Q/K/V 各 128KB + S/P 中间矩阵多次读写）","-- FlashAttention tiling: ~552 KB（约 15× 减少）","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-4-0span3-THUNDERKITTENS.md` (score: 2901)"," ","-**注解**: FlashAttention 的 tiling 设计揭示了 GPU kernel tiling 的核心约束——tile 必须 fit 在 on-chip SRAM（shared memory + L1）中，且需要在 tile size 和 SM occupancy 间权衡。更大的 B_c 减少 HBM passes 但增加 SRAM per block → 降低每 SM 并发 block 数。消融实验（Figure 2 middle）表明 B_c≥256 后进入 compute-bound regime。H100 的 228KB/SM（vs A100 164KB/SM）提供了更大的 tile size 空间。tile 形状还受 Tensor Core MMA fragment（16×16×16）对齐约束——B_r 和 B_c 必须是 16 的倍数才能高效利用 Tensor Core。","+ThunderKittens (TK) 定义了三层 tile 抽象，直接映射到 GPU 物理硬件层级："," ","----","+```","+GPU 硬件层级              TK 抽象              Tile 约束与参数","+═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════","+Warp (32 threads)         Register Tile        16×16 FP16/BF16 矩阵 tile","+                       支持 row-major / col-major layout","+                       匹配 Tensor Core mma.m16n8k16 的 fragment 格式","+                       通过 swizzle layout 最小化 shared memory bank conflict"," ","-### 1.4 WELDER：硬件对齐的 Tile Shape 搜索","+Warpgroup (4 warps)       Shared Tile          多 warp 协作的 shared memory tile","+                       自动选择 swizzle on 32/64/128 byte boundaries","+                       bank conflict: row-major naive → 8-way conflict","+                                      TK swizzle → 0-way or 2-way conflict"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` (score: 2897.4)","+Thread Block (CTA)        LCSF Template        异步 producer-consumer pipeline","+                       Load function (HBM→SMEM) | Compute function (SMEM→RF→MMA)","+                       Store function (RF→SMEM→HBM) | Finish function","+                       N-stage pipeline buffer (N=1,2,3,4)"," ","-WELDER 在 tile shape 枚举时通过三个硬件感知 penalty 引导搜索：","-","+Grid                      Persistent Grid       task_id→(row,col) 映射控制 L2 reuse","+                       Block Order            {8,N,M/8} 3D stride vs {N,M} row-major"," ```","-EnumerateSubtiles with hardware penalties（伪代码）:"," ","-for axis in output_axes:","-  tile = init_tile  // 从最小合法 tile 开始","-  while tile[axis] < tensor_dim[axis]:","-    tile[axis] = expand_toward_hardware_alignment(tile[axis])","+**TK 的 Shared Memory Bank Layout 策略**（笔记 Figure 4 描述）:"," ","-    // Penalty 1: Uncoalesced Memory Access","-    // CUDA GPU: 128B per transaction (32 × FP32 elements)","-    if not is_coalesced(tile, transaction_width=128B):","-      extra_traffic = calculate_extra_transactions(tile)","+| Layout | 16×64 16-bit Tile | Bank Conflicts | 额外内存 |","+|--------|-------------------|----------------|----------|","+| Row-major (naive) | 标准行优先 | 8-way（加载到 Tensor Core layout 时） | 无 |","+| Padded | 每行末尾补 1 个 word | 0-way | 额外 1 word/row |","+| TK swizzle (32B) | 32-byte 粒度交叠 | 2-way | 无 |","+| TK swizzle (64B) | 64-byte 粒度交叠 | 0-way | 无 |"," ","-    // Penalty 2: Parallelism","-    // V100: 80 SMs × 4 warp schedulers × 32 threads → min 128 parallelism","-    num_parallel_tiles = total_elements / tile_size","-    if num_parallel_tiles < hardware_parallelism:","-      extra_traffic *= (hardware_parallelism / num_parallel_tiles)","+**注解**:","+- **Bank conflict 对并发的影响**: 8-way bank conflict 会使 shared memory 有效带宽降至 1/8，严重序列化 warp 内的 memory 访问。TK 在编译期根据 tile width 自动选择最优 swizzle layout","+- **Multi-stage buffer**: 1-stage 仅 260 TFLOPS（GEMM 4096），4-stage 达到 760 TFLOPS——每增加 1 个 stage 增加 150-200 TFLOPS（H100，Table 1）","+- **Occupancy trade-off**: 更多 load workers → 更高 occupancy 但每 compute worker 更少的 register（160 registers → 64 registers）→ tile size 被迫缩小 → arithmetic intensity 降低"," ","-    // Penalty 3: Capacity (infinite penalty → 直接淘汰)","-    footprint = MemFootprint(graph_with_tile_config)","-    if footprint > target_memory_capacity: continue","-","-    // MMA fragment 整除约束","-    for axis marked as MMA_axis:","-      enforce_tile[axis] % MMA_fragment_size == 0  // e.g., 16 for FP16","-","-    configs.push(tile_config, priority=adjusted_traffic)","-```","-","-**注解**: WELDER 的硬件对齐策略体现了 tile shape 搜索的三个核心约束：(1) **访存对齐**——global memory 的合并访问需要 128B 对齐（32 个 FP32），tile 的 leading dimension 若不是 32 的倍数会导致非合并访问，每个线程需要多个 memory transaction；(2) **并行度约束**——tile 数量必须 ≥ 硬件最小并行度（80 SMs × 每个 SM 的 warp slots），否则部分 SM 空闲；(3) **容量约束**——tile 的 memory footprint 超过 shared memory/register file 容量直接淘汰。对于 Tensor Core，额外施加 MMA fragment size 整除约束（FP16: 16, INT8: 32），确保 tile 能映射到完整的 MMA 指令。","-"," ---"," ","-### 1.5 HyTiS：Tile Layout Scheduling 与 Wave Utilization","+## 二、Kernel 调度机制与微算子并发"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../HyTiS.../span-idpage-6-0span3.3-Tile-Layout-Scheduling.md` (score: 2988.0)","+### 2.1 Persistent Kernel：Mirage Persistent Kernel (MPK) 的 SM 级 tGraph"," ","-HyTiS 在确定 tile size 后进一步优化 tile layout——两种基础模式：","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 4149)"," ","-```","-Tile Layout 模式:","-  group-M (GM): 沿 M 维分组 tile，每组内沿 N 维连续","-  group-N (GN): 沿 N 维分组 tile，每组内沿 M 维连续","+MPK 将整个 tensor program 编译为单个 mega-kernel，通过 SM 级任务图 (tGraph) 实现跨算子微算子并发："," ","-Hopper vs Ampere 策略差异:","-  - Hopper (H100): 使用 persistent kernel + TMA 指令加速 global memory 加载","-  - Ampere (A100): 不用 persistent kernel（register 使用过高），","-                    不用 TMA 指令（不支持），采用传统 kernel 调度"," ```","+tGraph 表示（MPK §3）:","+  Task（蓝/橙矩形）: 单个 SM 上执行的计算/通信单元","+  Event（绿圆）:     task 间同步点"," ","-**注解**: HyTiS 揭示了 tile layout 对 GPU wave utilization 和 L2 cache locality 的影响。在 Hopper 架构上，persistent kernel 消除 CTA launch overhead，TMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）通过异步 bulk copy（`cp.async.bulk`）实现高效的 global→shared 数据传输，同时 TMA 的硬件地址计算减轻了 SM 的地址生成压力。而在 Ampere 上，persistent kernel 的 register 开销过高（因为需要 while-loop 控制流和全局状态跟踪），因此传统多-wave kernel launch 更高效——这体现了硬件架构对调度策略的根本性影响。","+  依赖结构: Task → Event (trigger) / Event → Task (depend)","+  例: MatMul task₁ 完成 → 触发 Event e₁ → AllReduce task₁ 可执行","+      不同 SM 上 MatMul task 完成后立即触发对应的 AllReduce task","+      → 不同 SM 可在不同时间点进入 AllReduce 阶段（无全局 barrier）"," ","----","+MPK 编译流程（Figure 5）:","+  Step 1: Operator decomposition — 按 output 维度沿 SM 数 partition","+  Step 2: Dependency analysis — 枚举 producer-consumer task pair，插入 event","+  Step 3: Event fusion — successor-set + predecessor-set fusion 消除冗余同步点","+  Step 4: tGraph normalization — 每 task 至多 1 dependent + 1 triggering event","+  Step 5: tGraph linearization (Algorithm 1, BFS) — 同 event 触发 task 连续排列","+  Step 6: GPU device memory 紧凑存储 — task: {dep_event, trig_event}","+                                         event: {trigger_count, first_task, last_task}","+```"," ","-## 2. Kernel 调度机制","+**In-Kernel Runtime 执行伪代码**（MPK §5, event-driven）:"," ","-### 2.1 Persistent Kernel（持久化 Kernel）","+```cuda","+// MPK mega-kernel: 每个 SM 独立执行 event-driven task loop","+__global__ void mpk_mega_kernel() {","+    int sm_id = get_smid();"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 4211.2)","+    while (true) {","+        // Step 1: 等待 dependent event 激活（device memory spin-wait）","+        int dep_ev = task_table[sm_id].dependent_event;","+        if (dep_ev >= 0)","+            while (atomicLoad(&event_status[dep_ev]) != ACTIVATED) { /* spin */ }"," ","-Persistent kernel 的核心思想：一次 launch 后持续运行，kernel 内部通过 while-loop 轮询新任务，直到所有工作完成才 return。与传统 kernel-per-operator 模式的对比：","+        // Step 2: 执行当前 task","+        TaskDesc t = task_table[sm_id];","+        switch (t.type) {","+            case TASK_MATMUL:    sm_gemm(t.A, t.B, t.C, t.M, t.N, t.K); break;","+            case TASK_ATTENTION: sm_attention(t.Q, t.K, t.V, t.O, ...);  break;","+            case TASK_RMSNORM:   sm_rmsnorm(t.X, t.Y, t.N, t.eps);       break;","+            case TASK_ALLREDUCE: sm_allreduce(t.in, t.out, t.size);      break;","+            // ...","+        }"," ","-```","-传统模式 (kernel-per-operator):","-  CPU: launch(GEMM0) → wait → launch(GELU) → wait → launch(GEMM1) → wait → ...","-  GPU: execute → idle → execute → idle → execute → idle → ...","-  问题: CPU-GPU sync overhead, kernel launch overhead, GPU idle gaps","+        // Step 3: 通知 triggering event","+        int trig_ev = task_table[sm_id].trigger_event;","+        if (trig_ev >= 0) {","+            int cnt = atomicAdd(&event_counter[trig_ev], 1);","+            if (cnt + 1 == event_expected[trig_ev])","+                atomicStore(&event_status[trig_ev], ACTIVATED);","+        }"," ","-Persistent Kernel 模式:","-  CPU: launch(megakernel) ──────────────────────→ (单次 launch)","-  GPU: while(!all_done):","-         task = scheduler.get_next_task()","-         switch(task.type):","-           case GEMM0:  CUTLASS_device_GEMM(...); break","-           case GEMM1:  CUTLASS_device_GEMM(...); break","-           case COMM:   NVSHMEM_put(...); break","-         notify_scheduler()","+        // Step 4: 获取下一个 task（decentralized — 无集中调度器）","+        sm_id = next_task_in_linearized_queue(sm_id);","+    }","+}"," ```"," ","-**FlashMoE Persistent Kernel 伪代码**（基于笔记重构）:","+**注解**:","+- **数据结构**: `task_table`、`event_status`、`event_counter` 均存储在 GPU global memory 中，SM 通过 L2 cache 访问（atomic 操作在 L2 的 atomic unit 处理）","+- **并发粒度**: 每个 SM 独立调度——SM₀ 可能在执行 Attention task 的同时 SM₁ 在执行 AllReduce task（跨算子重叠），而 SM₂ 尚在执行上一个 MatMul task","+- **vs CUDA Graph**: CUDA Graph 的依赖是 kernel 级（kernel A → kernel B），所有 SM 必须等 kernel A 完成后才能开始 kernel B；MPK tGraph 的依赖是 SM task 级（task A₁ → task B₁），task B₁ 可以在 task A₁ 完成后立即启动而不等待其他 SM 的 task A","+- **编译 vs 运行时权衡**: tGraph 在编译期完全静态化（normalization + linearization），运行时无动态调度开销；代价是无法处理 dynamic shape——所有 tensor shape 必须在编译期已知"," ","-```cuda","-// 输入: A[S×H]=输入token矩阵, O[S×H]=输出矩阵, X[E×H×D]=expert权重, N=blocks/GPU","-// Grid: N blocks, Block: 128 threads","-__global__ void flashmoe_megakernel(A, O, X, N) {","-    // ===== Phase 1: Fused Gate (所有 block 参与) =====","-    T_phi, G_phi = FusedGate(A);  // routing table + affinity scores","+### 2.2 Persistent Grid + Block Order：ThunderKittens 的 Grid 级调度"," ","-    __syncthreads();  // 全局 barrier","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block Order Scheduling _ L2 Cache Reuse (GPU).md` (score: 32.7); `paper_secs/.../ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-4-0span3-THUNDERKITTENS.md` (score: 2901)"," ","-    // ===== Phase 2: 角色分工 =====","-    if (blockId < N - 1) {","-        // === Processor 角色: 执行计算任务 ===","-        Dispatch(T_phi, A);  // 发送 token tile 到目标 GPU","+**Persistent Grid 机制**（TK §3.3）："," ","-        while (!interrupt) {","-            task = poll_global_memory_doorbell();  // 等待 Scheduler 分配任务","-            if (task == NO_TASK) continue;          // spin-wait","+```cuda","+// 传统 launch: grid = ceil(total_tiles / tiles_per_block) blocks","+//            每个 block 处理 1 个 tile → N 个 tile = N 次 launch（或 N grid 再填满）"," ","-            switch (task.type) {","-                case GEMM0:","-                    // CUTLASS device-side fused GEMM: A×W1 → GELU → +bias","-                    // tile shape: (128, 64), registers=255/thread","-                    CUTLASS_device_fused_GEMM0(task.input, task.weight, task.output);","-                    notify_scheduler(task.done_flag);","-                    break;","+// Persistent grid: grid = SM_count blocks（如 132 blocks for H100）","+//            每个 block 在 kernel 内循环处理多个 tile","+__global__ void persistent_gemm_kernel(float* A, float* B, float* C,","+                                        int M, int N, int K) {","+    int sm_id = get_smid();","+    int tile_idx = sm_id;  // 初始 tile 分配"," ","-                case GEMM1:","-                    // CUTLASS device-side GEMM: C1×W2 → identity epilogue","-                    CUTLASS_device_GEMM1(task.input, task.weight, task.output);","-                    // 通过 NVSHMEM 将结果 put 到目标 GPU 的 combine buffer","-                    NVSHMEM_put(task.output, remote_combine_buffer[task.target_gpu],","-                                task.size, task.target_pe);","-                    notify_subscriber(task.done_flag);","-                    break;","+    while (tile_idx < total_tiles) {","+        int row = TILE_ROW_MAP_3D_STRIDE(tile_idx);  // {8, N, M/8} mapping","+        int col = TILE_COL_MAP_3D_STRIDE(tile_idx);"," ","-                case COMBINE:","-                    // expert-combine: 加权合并多 expert 输出","-                    combine_weighted(task.input, task.affinity_weights, task.output);","-                    break;","-            }","-        }","+        // LCSF pipeline for tile (row, col)","+        load_tile_to_smem(A, B, row, col);    // TMA async load","+        compute_tile_on_tensor_core(row, col); // MMA warpgroup","+        store_tile_to_hbm(C, row, col);        // TMA async store"," ","-    } else {","-        // === OS Block (blockId == N-1) ===","-        if (warpID == 0) {","-            // Scheduler Warp: 多线程任务调度","-            while (!all_done) {","-                // 扫描 doorbell 获取就绪任务","-                ready_tasks = sweep_doorbells();","-                // WarpInclusiveSum 计算就绪任务总数","-                total_ready = WarpInclusiveSum(ready_tasks.count);","-                // 将就绪任务分配给空闲 Processor","-                assign_tasks_to_idle_processors(ready_tasks);","-            }","-        } else {","-            // Subscriber Warps (warp 1-3): 解码远程 tile","-            while (!all_done) {","-                // Poll remote GPU 发来的 tile packet flags","-                remote_tile = poll_remote_flags();","-                if (remote_tile.ready) {","-                    task_desc = decode_tile_to_task(remote_tile, T_phi, G_phi);","-                    enqueue_task(task_desc);  // 放入 Scheduler 队列","-                    signal_scheduler_doorbell();","-                }","-            }","-        }","+        tile_idx = atomicAdd(&global_tile_counter, 1);  // 原子获取下一个 tile","     }"," }"," ```"," ","-**注解**: Persistent kernel 的核心优势：(1) 消除 kernel launch overhead——FlashMoE 仅 1 次 launch vs baseline 33-550 次（Table 1）；(2) 在 kernel 内实现 work-conserving 调度——Scheduler 持续扫描就绪任务并分配，避免 SM 空闲；(3) device-side BLAS（CUTLASS device API）在 kernel 内执行完整 GEMM，无需退出 kernel；(4) 通过 NVSHMEM 实现 kernel 内跨 GPU 通信。代价：(a) register 开销大（需维护全局状态、while-loop 控制流、任务队列），在 register-poor 架构（如 Ampere 的 persistent kernel，笔记提到 \"persistent kernels incur excessive register file usage\" on Ampere）上反而降低 occupancy；(b) 工程复杂度极高（FlashMoE 6820 行 CUDA/C++）。FlashMoE 实测达到 93.17% SM utilization（vs baseline 9.67-59.11%）。","+**Block Order 对 L2 Cache 和性能的影响**（笔记 Table 2/3）:"," ","----","+| Kernel | Block Order | HBM GB/s | TFLOPS | 分析 |","+|--------|------------|----------|--------|------|","+| GEMM (M=N=K=16384) | {8, N, M/8} (3D stride) | 982 | 805 | 相邻 block 复用 A 矩阵行数据 → L2 hit |","+| GEMM (M=N=K=16384) | {N, M} (row-major) | 3070 | 392 | 相邻 block 遍历不同 row → L2 miss → 被迫从 HBM 重载 |","+| Attention (d=128) | {N, H, B} (seq 连续) | 213 | 600 | 相邻 block 复用同一序列位置的 KV |","+| Attention (d=128) | {B, H, N} (batch 连续) | 2390 | 494 | batch 间无数据复用 → 大量 L2 miss |"," ","-### 2.2 Grid-Stride Loop（栅格跨步循环）","+**注解**:","+- **关键洞察**: **更低 HBM 带宽 ≠ 更低性能**——策略 A 在 GEMM 上 HBM 仅 982 GB/s 但达到 805 TFLOPS（大部分访问命中 L2 cache 12 TB/s），策略 B HBM 高达 3070 GB/s 但仅 392 TFLOPS（L2 miss 迫使从 HBM 3.35 TB/s 加载）","+- **L2 cache resident 数据量**: GEMM 中 A 矩阵行在 3D stride 下被连续执行的 block 复用，一次加载可服务 8 个连续 block（`SUPER_M=8`），将有效 HBM 带宽需求降低 8×","+- **Persistent grid + Block order 组合**: persistent grid 消除 block launch overhead（64μs/launch → 0），block order 最大化 L2 reuse，两者配合实现最优 kernel 效率"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记未详细说明 grid-stride loop 实现细节。以下基于可推断的 CUDA 编程范式补充。","+### 2.3 Grid-Stride Loop 与 Dynamic Parallelism"," ","-Grid-stride loop 是一种经典的 CUDA 编程模式，允许单个 thread block 处理多个 tile，通过跨步（stride = gridDim）迭代覆盖超过 grid 数量的数据块：","+**Grid-Stride Loop**（经典 CUDA 范式，用于替代 persistent kernel 的轻量方案）:"," "," ```cuda","-// Grid-stride loop 模式（可推断）:","-// Grid: G blocks, 每个 block 处理 data_size / (G × block_size) 个 tile","-__global__ void grid_stride_kernel(float* data, int N) {","+// Grid-stride loop: grid 大小固定（如 = #SM × max_blocks/SM）","+// 每 thread 跨步处理多个元素","+__global__ void grid_stride_moe_kernel(float* tokens, int total_tokens) {","     int tid = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;","     int stride = blockDim.x * gridDim.x;  // grid-stride"," ","-    // 每个线程处理多个元素（跨步迭代）","-    for (int i = tid; i < N; i += stride) {","-        // 计算逻辑","-        data[i] = f(data[i]);","+    // 每个线程跨步处理多个 token","+    for (int i = tid; i < total_tokens; i += stride) {","+        int expert_id = routing_table[i];","+        float* weight = expert_weights[expert_id];","+        // tile-level GEMM on this token subset","+        compute_expert_ffn(tokens + i * H, weight, output + i * H);","     }"," }","-","-// 应用于 tile 调度:","-// Grid: G_SM × N_blocks_per_SM 个 CTA","-// 每个 CTA 通过 grid-stride 处理 ceil(total_tiles / G_SM) 个 tile","+// 优势: 无 spin-wait、无 doorbell、无中心调度器 → 更低 register 压力","+// 劣势: 无 work-conserving 能力——某些 expert 的 token 多时无法动态负载均衡"," ```"," ","-**注解**: Grid-stride loop 的优势是灵活——grid size 可以固定（如 = SM 数量 × max blocks/SM），不依赖输入大小，特别适合 persistent kernel 的替代方案。与 persistent kernel 的区别：grid-stride loop 中所有 CTA 独立并行、无显式同步；persistent kernel 中 CTA 通过全局 flags/doorbells 协同、有中心化调度器。对于 MoE 场景，当 expert 数量多但每个 expert token 少时，grid-stride 允许每个 CTA 处理多个小 expert 的 tile，避免 CTA 数量不足导致的负载不均。","+**Dynamic Parallelism**（device-side kernel launch，笔记提及但未提供 MoE benchmark）:","+- GPU 端通过 `cudaLaunchDevice()` 根据 gating 结果动态启动 expert kernel","+- 优势：避免 CPU round-trip，根据运行时 token 分布动态决定 launch 哪些 expert","+- 限制：每次 device-side launch ~5-10μs 延迟；与 CUDA Graph 不兼容；子 kernel 不支持 persistent kernel 的 work-conserving 调度；笔记未提供 MoE/DiT 场景实验数据"," "," ---"," ","-### 2.3 Dynamic Parallelism（动态并行）","+## 三、GPU SM 微架构：Warp Scheduler 驱动的 Tile 级并发"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../87-Automated End-to-End Model Serving.../span-idpage-8-0span5.4-Execute-Tasks.md` (score: 645.5)","+### 3.1 SM 内部数据流与控制模块"," ","-笔记显示存在一个 \"daemon kernel\" 使用 CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP) 在 device 端直接 launch kernel：","-","+```mermaid","+flowchart TD","+    A[\"HBM3e (80GB, 3.35TB/s)\"] -->|\"TMA async copy (独立硬件单元)\"| B[\"L2 Cache (50MB, 12TB/s H100)\"]","+    B -->|\"128B cache line\"| C[\"Shared Memory/L1 (228KB/SM H100)\"]","+    C -->|\"lds.128 (128B/cycle/SM)\"| D[\"Register File (65536×32b/SM)\"]","+    D -->|\"operand fetch (4 operands/cycle/warp)\"| E[\"Warp Scheduler ×4\"]","+    E -->|\"dispatch 1 inst/warp/cycle\"| F[\"CUDA Core (128 FP32/SM)\"]","+    E -->|\"dispatch 1 MMA/warp/cycle\"| G[\"Tensor Core (4× 4th-gen/SM)\"]","+    F -->|\"FP32 result\"| D","+    G -->|\"MMA accumulator (FP32)\"| D","+    D -->|\"st.shared (128B/cycle)\"| C","+    C -->|\"TMA async store\"| B","+    B -->|\"write-back\"| A","+    E -->|\"stall→swap warp (0-cycle overhead)\"| H[\"Warp Slot Pool (max 64 warps/SM)\"]"," ```","-Device-side kernel launch（基于笔记描述）:","-  - GPU 上运行一个 persistent \"daemon kernel\"","-  - daemon kernel 利用 cudaLaunchDevice() 在 GPU 端直接 launch 子 kernel","-  - \"Fire-and-forget\" 启动模式：子 kernel 由 GPU 硬件调度器立即调度","-  - 消除 CPU→GPU kernel launch 延迟","-```"," ","-**注解**: Dynamic parallelism 允许 GPU kernel 在运行时根据数据条件动态 launch 新的子 kernel。在 MoE 场景中特别有用——可以根据 gating 结果动态决定需要执行哪些 expert kernel，避免 CPU 端的 round-trip。但 CDP 有显著开销：(1) 每次 device-side launch 有 ~5-10μs 延迟（远小于 CPU launch 的 ~10-20μs，但仍是 persistent kernel 的额外开销）；(2) 子 kernel 的 grid/block 维度在 launch 时确定，不支持 persistent kernel 的 work-conserving 动态调度；(3) CDP 与 CUDA Graph 不兼容。笔记未提供 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 场景下 CDP 的详细实验数据。","+**注解**:","+- **MAC 数量**: H100 SM: 128 FP32 CUDA Core/SM × 2 FMA/cycle × 1.98 GHz = ~507 GFLOPS/SM FP32；4× 4th-gen Tensor Core/SM: FP16 MMA 989 TFLOPS/chip ÷ 132 SMs ≈ 7.5 TFLOPS/SM","+- **带宽数值**: HBM3e 3.35 TB/s (chip)；L2 12 TB/s；SMEM 128B/cycle × 1.98 GHz × 132 SMs ≈ 33 TB/s aggregate","+- **流水线级数**: TMA 异步搬运 ~300-500 cycles latency；Tensor Core MMA ~1 cycle/instruction（但不包括 operand fetch latency）；Global memory load ~300-800 cycles","+- **Warp Scheduler 状态机**: 每 scheduler 管理 16 warps max（4 scheduler × 16 = 64 warps/SM）。状态: ready / stalled(mem) / stalled(exec dependency) / selected。Scheduler 在每 cycle 从 ready warps 中选 1 个 dispatch 1 条指令——公平轮询，无优先级。这保证了当有足够 ready warps 时，memory latency 可被完全隐藏"," ","----","+### 3.2 Instruction Pipeline 时序图：Producer-Consumer 异步流水线（H100）"," ","-### 2.4 Cooperative Groups","+以 ThunderKittens LCSF 模板的 Attention kernel（2-stage pipeline buffer, H100）为例:"," ","-**笔记证据**: 笔记未详细说明 cooperative groups。以下为可推断补充。","+```","+时间 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────→","+       T0     T1     T2     T3     T4     T5     T6     T7     T8"," ","-Cooperative Groups 是 CUDA 9+ 引入的编程模型，允许在 kernel 内进行跨 warp/跨 block 的细粒度同步。与传统的 `__syncthreads()`（仅同步 block 内线程）相比，`cooperative_groups::grid_group::sync()` 可以实现跨整个 grid 的同步。在 MoE persistent kernel 中可用于 expert barrier（所有 Processor 完成当前 expert 的 GEMM 后再切换到下一个 expert），但 grid-level sync 代价高（需要所有 block 同时到达 barrier 点），实际系统中更倾向于使用 doorbell/flag 机制（如 FlashMoE 的设计）。","+Warp 0-3 (Load Workers):","+       ┌─────┐       ┌─────┐       ┌─────┐","+       │ TMA │       │ TMA │       │ TMA │","+       │Load │       │Load │       │Load │","+       │Tile0│       │Tile1│       │Tile2│","+       └──┬──┘       └──┬──┘       └──┬──┘","+          │arrive()      │arrive()      │arrive()","+          ▼              ▼              ▼","+Warp 4-7 (Compute Workers):","+             ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐","+             │MMA Q×K^T │ │MMA Q×K^T │ │MMA Q×K^T │","+             │+ Softmax │ │+ Softmax │ │+ Softmax │","+             │MMA Att×V │ │MMA Att×V │ │MMA Att×V │","+             │  (Tile0) │ │  (Tile1) │ │  (Tile2) │","+             └────┬─────┘ └────┬─────┘ └────┬─────┘","+                  │arrive()    │arrive()    │arrive()","+                  ▼            ▼            ▼","+Warp 0-3:","+       ┌─────┐       ┌─────┐       ┌─────┐","+       │ TMA │       │ TMA │       │ TMA │","+       │Store│       │Store│       │Store│","+       │Tile0│       │Tile1│       │Tile2│","+       └─────┘       └─────┘       └─────┘"," ","----","+图例: ┌──┐ = 执行时间段, ▼ = arrive() 同步信号 (mbarrier)","+```"," ","-## 3. 多算子/微算子并发策略","+**注解**:","+- **TMA vs cp.async**: H100 的 TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) 是独立硬件单元，不占用 SM warp scheduler/ALU。`cp.async.bulk` 发起后 warp 立即释放（fire-and-forget vs Ampere `cp.async` 需 commit group + wait）","+- **mbarrier**: H100 引入的硬件 barrier——`arrive()` → mbarrier 到达信号（~10-20 cycles），compute worker 通过 `mbarrier.try_wait()` 轮询（或阻塞等待）。比传统 `__syncthreads()` (~100 cycles) 更快且支持 warp-level（vs block-level）同步","+- **Pipeline depth 影响**: 2-stage buffer（load Tile₁ || compute Tile₀）→ 484 TFLOPS；4-stage → 760 TFLOPS。但每增加 1 stage 增加 1 份 SMEM buffer（stage×tile_size bytes），4-stage 需要 4× tile 的 SMEM → 减小 max tile size → 需权衡","+- **warp specialization**: Load worker（warp 0-3）仅执行 TMA 发起 + mbarrier arrive + 地址计算；Compute worker（warp 4-7）仅执行 MMA + ALU。物理隔离意味着各自的 register file 分区不互相挤占（load worker 仅需 ~32 registers，compute worker 可用满 ~255 registers）"," ","-### 3.1 MoE Expert FFN：GroupGEMM Tile 调度","+### 3.3 ILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 Trade-off"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE).md` (score: 8906.1)；`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Group GEMM for MoE Inference.md` (score: 7313.5)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 2891)"," "," ```","-GroupGEMM Tile 调度（标准 vs Comet 重排序）:","+Infera 形式化模型:","+  #inst ≈ #ops × (a/I + b)     // I = Arithmetic Intensity = #ops / #bytes"," ","-# 标准 CUTLASS GroupGEMM 调度:","-for problem_idx in range(num_experts):","-    m = token_counts[problem_idx]     # 该 expert 的 token 数","-    for tile_m in range(0, m, TILE_M):","-        for tile_k in range(0, K, TILE_K):","-            for tile_n in range(0, N, TILE_N):","-                GEMM_tile(tile_m, tile_n, tile_k)","+Trade-off 约束:","+  ILP ↑  →  register/thread ↑  →  max warps/SM ↓  →  TLP ↓","+  Intensity ↑  →  SMEM/block ↑    →  max blocks/SM ↓  →  TLP ↓","+  TLP = f(registers_per_thread, smem_per_block, MAX_RF/SM, MAX_SMEM/SM)"," ","-# Comet 重排序调度（通信-计算重叠优化）:","-tiles_sorted = sort_tiles_by_remote_dependency(","-    all_tiles,","-    key=lambda t: count_remote_tokens(t),  # local tile 优先","-    ascending=True","-)","-for tile in tiles_sorted:","-    GEMM_tile(tile)","+A100 典型配置空间 (Infera, 36 种 baseline 组合):","+  register:   64 / 96 / 128 /thread      → ILP 梯度","+  SMEM:       48 / 80 / 112 / 144 KiB/block → Intensity 梯度","+  pipeline:   2 / 3 / 4 stages            → async overlap 梯度"," ","-在 Hopper 上的实现细节:","-  - TMA (cp.async.bulk): producer warp 异步加载 global→shared","-  - consumer warp 在 Tensor Core 上执行 MMA","-  - 形成 producer-consumer 软件流水线","-  - Comet 在 tile 调度层注入重排序，不改动流水线本身","+  例: register=128/thread → max warps = 65536/(128×32) = 16 warps/SM","+      register=64/thread  → max warps = 65536/(64×32)  = 32 warps/SM","+      SMEM=144KB/block    → max blocks = floor(164KB/144KB) = 1 block/SM","+      SMEM=48KB/block     → max blocks = floor(164KB/48KB)  = 3 blocks/SM"," ```"," ","-**EPS-MoE 的动态 GEMM 选择策略**（笔记证据）:","+**注解**:","+- **峰值性能区域**: 三维空间中的 \"green box\"（ILP、TLP、Intensity 平衡点）。过多 ILP → occupancy 崩溃（register 耗尽无足够 warp 隐藏延迟）；过多 TLP → 每 warp 内指令串行依赖无法 ILP 隐藏；过多 Intensity → tile 过大导致 SMEM 溢出或 blocks/SM = 1","+- **H100 的缓解**: 更大的 shared memory (228KB vs A100 164KB) + 更多的 Tensor Core throughput (989 vs 312 TFLOPS FP16) → 允许更大 tile 同时保持高 TLP"," ","-| 输入 token 数 m | 推荐 GEMM 实现 | 原因 |","-|-----------------|---------------|------|","-| m < 2048 (decode 阶段) | GroupGEMM | 小 batch 时 per-expert launch overhead 占比高，合并为 GroupGEMM 消除 overhead |","-| m ≥ 4096 (prefill 阶段) | DenseGEMM (cuBLAS) | 大 batch 时 GroupGEMM 的 group 管理开销超过收益，cuBLAS 的 dense kernel 效率更高 |","+---"," ","-**注解**: GroupGEMM 的 tile 调度核心挑战是不同 expert 的输入 token 数差异巨大（MoE routing 的动态性）。当单个 expert token 数少于 TILE_M 时，需要 padding 或使用更小的 tile；当 token 数远大于 TILE_M 时，可沿 M 维切分为多个 tile。Hopper TMA 的引入使得 GEMM 的 global→shared 数据搬运从 SM 的 ALU 指令中解放（TMA 使用独立的硬件单元），producer warp 只需发起 TMA 请求，后续数据传输由 TMA 硬件完成，consumer warp 可以全时执行 MMA。","+## 四、NPU 达芬奇架构的 Tile 尺寸约束"," ","----","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910 AI Accelerator（昇腾910 AI加速器）.md`; `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Huawei Ascend 910B3 NPU.md`"," ","-### 3.2 Tile 级通信-计算融合（Intra-operator Overlap）","+### 4.1 Da Vinci 架构 Tile 约束"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels.md` (score: 5519.8)","+Ascend 910/910B 基于自研达芬奇 (Da Vinci) 架构，采用粗粒度 Tile-based 模型："," ","-MegaScale-MoE 实现的四类 tile 级融合 kernel：","+| 组件 | 规格 | 功能 | Tile 约束 |","+|------|------|------|-----------|","+| **AI Cores** | 32 (910A) / 20 (910B3) | 通用矩阵/向量/标量计算 | 每 AI Core 独立执行 tile |","+| **Cube Unit** | 脉动阵列 (具体尺寸笔记未标) | 矩阵乘 GEMM | M/K 维需对齐 Cube array size（推测 16×16×16） |","+| **Vector Unit** | 向量处理单元 | 激活函数/LayerNorm/element-wise | 向量化宽度对齐（典型 256-bit） |","+| **Scalar Unit** | 标量单元 | 控制流/地址计算 | 无 tile 约束 |","+| **MTE** | Memory Transfer Engine | DMA 数据搬运 | 独立于计算单元，可完全与 Cube/Vector 重叠 |","+| **L0 Buffer** | AI Core 内部 buffer | 最 close-to-compute buffer | tile 必须 fit in L0 buffer |","+| **L1 Buffer** | AI Core 间共享 buffer | 跨 AI Core 数据共享 | 类似 GPU L2 cache，但笔记未提供带宽数值 |","+| **HBM** | 64GB (910B3) / 32GB (910A) | 全局内存 | 带宽 1.07 TB/s (910A) |"," ","+### 4.2 NPU Kernel Tile 映射伪代码","+"," ```","-类型 1: A2A + GEMM（Attention Output Projection）","-┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│ SM 分配: 少量 SM 处理 A2A 通信管理                    │","-│          其余 SM 全部用于 GEMM 计算                    │","-│                                                      │","-│ 时间线:                                               │","-│ T0: launch_local_GEMM_tiles() + launch_A2A_async()   │","-│ T1: ┌─ SM₀..SMₖ: GEMM(local_tile_0) ──────────┐     │","-│     │  Copy Engine: A2A(remote_tile_0) ────────│     │","-│ T2: └─ device_memory_barrier_poll(remote_ready)┘     │","-│ T3: ┌─ SM₀..SMₖ: GEMM(remote_tile_0) ─────────┐     │","-│     │  Copy Engine: A2A(remote_tile_1) ────────│     │","-│     ...                                              │","-└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","+// Ascend 910B MoE expert FFN kernel tile 映射（TIK 编程模型风格）","+// hidden_dim=4096, ffn_dim=14336, BLOCK_M=128, Cube Unit tile=16×16"," ","-类型 3: AG + Scatter + GroupedGEMM（FFN Token Dispatch）","-  关键优化: 排序使每个 computation tile 依赖尽可能少的 source rank","-  sorted_tokens = sort_by_expert_then_source_rank(input_tokens)","-  → 每个 tile 的理想情况: 仅依赖 1 个 source rank","-  → 减少 device_memory_barrier_poll 等待次数","+def tik_moe_expert_kernel(token_block[BLOCK_M, H], w1_gate[H, D], w1_up[H, D], w2[D, H]):","+    // Phase 1: Cube Unit — 双 GEMM (Gate + Up 投影)","+    // Cube Unit 每 cycle 处理 16×16×16 MAC","+    // tile 循环: ceil(D/16) 次沿 ffn_dim 维度","+    for i in range(0, D, 16):","+        gate_tile[BLOCK_M, i:i+16] = cube_matmul(token_block, w1_gate[:, i:i+16])","+        up_tile[BLOCK_M, i:i+16]   = cube_matmul(token_block, w1_up[:, i:i+16])","+        // Cube Unit 计算的同时 MTE 预取下一个 tile 的 weight","+","+    // Phase 2: Vector Unit — SiLU activation（element-wise, 不可在 Cube 上执行）","+    hidden[BLOCK_M, D] = vec_silu(gate_tile) ⊙ up_tile  // ⊙ = element-wise multiply","+","+    // Phase 3: Cube Unit — Down 投影","+    for i in range(0, H, 16):","+        out_tile[BLOCK_M, i:i+16] = cube_matmul(hidden, w2[:, i:i+16])","+","+    // Phase 4: Vector Unit — routing weight 加权","+    out_tile = vec_scale(out_tile, routing_weight[BLOCK_M])","+","+    // Phase 5: MTE — 写回 HBM（与下一个 token block 的 Phase 1 重叠）","+    mte_async_copy_to_hbm(out_tile)"," ```"," ","-**注解**: Tile 级融合实现了跨算子的微算子并发——在有数据依赖的算子间（如 A2A dispatch → expert GEMM），将整个工作负载按 tile 切分后，不同 tile 的计算和通信可以流水线化执行。SM 分配策略（通信管理用少量 SM、计算用大量 SM）通过 profiling 调优使通信和计算的延时匹配（通信 latency ≈ 计算 latency），避免一方等待另一方。Swizzling（重排 tile 执行顺序）使各 rank 的 remote data 到达节奏与 GEMM tile 消费节奏对齐，避免多 rank 同时读写导致的 NVLink 带宽争用。","+**注解**:","+- **Cube vs Tensor Core**: Cube Unit 是同步脉动阵列（data stationary），数据流入后固定延迟输出；Tensor Core 是异步 warp-level MMA，可与 CUDA Core 指令交错。Cube Unit 的 GEMM 吞吐量依赖 tile 能否精确 fit array size——tile 太小（如 BLOCK_M < 16）会大量 PE 空闲","+- **三单元并发**: 在处理 tile_i 的 GEMM（Cube Unit）时，tile_{i-1} 的 activation 在 Vector Unit 上执行，tile_{i+1} 的 weight 由 MTE 预取——形成硬件级 pipeline。这是 Ascend 架构的天然优势：异构单元天然支持微算子并发","+- **笔记未明确**: Cube Unit 的具体 MAC array 尺寸（推测 16×16×16，与 GPU MMA 类似）、Vector Unit 的 SIMD 宽度、L0/L1 buffer 具体容量和带宽"," "," ---"," ","-### 3.3 Mirage Persistent Kernel (MPK)：SM 级 tGraph 并发调度","+## 五、TPU MXU Systolic Array 的 Tile 形状限制"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 3408.0)","+**笔记证据**: 该链条节点无 note evidence。以下基于可推断知识和 TPU 公开架构文档补充。"," ","-MPK 将 tensor program 编译为 SM 级的 task graph (tGraph)，每个 SM 执行一个 task，通过 device-memory event 同步：","+### 5.1 MXU Tile 约束"," ","-```","-tGraph 结构:","-  Task (蓝/橙矩形): 单 SM 上执行的计算/通信单元","-  Event (绿圆): task 间的同步点","+| TPU 代数 | MXU 尺寸 | 支持精度 | Tile 对齐要求 |","+|----------|----------|----------|--------------|","+| TPU v3 | 128×128 | BF16 | 矩阵乘 M/K 维需整除 128 或 padding |","+| TPU v4 | 128×128 | BF16/INT8 | 同 v3；4 个 MXU per chip |","+| TPU v5e | 128×128 | BF16/INT8 | 同 v4；更小 chip（单 MXU） |","+| TPU v5p | 128×128 或 128×256 | BF16/INT8/FP8 | 支持 FP8 训练；更大 VPU memory |"," ","-任务调度:","-  1. tGraph 归一化: 每个 task 最多 1 个 dependent event + 1 个 triggering event","-  2. tGraph 线性化 (BFS): 同一 event 触发的 task 在存储中连续","-  3. GPU 内存中的紧凑表示:","-     - Per task: dependent_event_idx, triggering_event_idx","-     - Per event: trigger_count, first_task_idx, last_task_idx","+### 5.2 GPU vs TPU Tile 约束的本质差异"," ","-对比 CUDA Graph:","-  CUDA Graph:  kernel 级依赖、stream 同步","-  MPK tGraph:   SM 级依赖、device-memory event 同步","-                → 支持 intra-kernel 跨算子重叠（如 MatMul+AllReduce）"," ```","+GPU (H100 Tensor Core):               TPU (v5p MXU):","+┌────────────────────────┐            ┌──────────────────────────┐","+│ SM₁ SM₂ SM₃ ... SM₁₃₂ │            │ MXU (128×128 systolic)   │","+│ 每 SM: 4 TC × MMA tile │            │ 整个 chip 级计算单元      │","+│        (16×16×16)      │            │ 必须填满 128×128 才高效   │","+│                        │            │                          │","+│ 灵活:                  │            │ 刚性:                    │","+│  - 不同 SM 可处理不同   │            │  - 所有 GEMM 必须适配     │","+│    tile size (组合 MMA) │            │    128 宽度              │","+│  - warp 可独立使用 TC   │            │  - 无 \"warp tile\" 子划分  │","+│  - tile 只需整除 16     │            │  - XLA 编译期静态 tile    │","+└────────────────────────┘            └──────────────────────────┘"," ","-**注解**: MPK 的 tGraph 将并发粒度从 kernel 级提升到 SM 级——传统 CUDA Graph 只能在 kernel 边界表达依赖，而 tGraph 可以在 kernel 内部的 SM task 间表达精确的 producer-consumer 依赖（如 MatMul task 的输出 tile 直接被后续 AllReduce task 消费，无需等待整个 MatMul kernel 完成）。Event fusion（successor-set / predecessor-set）消除冗余同步点，减少 barrier 开销。归一化 + 线性化使依赖存储紧凑且访问模式 cache-friendly。","+MoE 场景的关键差异:","+  - GPU: expert 的 token 少 → 小 tile (M=64) → 多个 warp 处理不同 expert 的 tile","+  - TPU: expert 的 token 少 → 必须 padding 到 128 → MXU 大量 PE 空闲","+    → GPU 在 expert 数量多但每 expert token 少时 tile 灵活性更优","+```"," ","+**注解**:","+- **XLA 编译策略**: JAX/XLA 在编译时根据 MXU 尺寸自动推导 tiling scheme——用户无需手动指定 tile size。XLA 的 `GemmFusion` pass 将多个 GEMM 合并为更大的矩阵乘以提高 MXU occupancy","+- **VPU memory**: TPU 的 Vector Processing Unit 有专用片上 memory，size 约 16-32MB per chip。MXU tile 的输入/输出需 fit 在 VPU memory 中——类似 GPU shared memory 约束但容量更大（16MB vs 228KB/SM）","+- **Padding 开销**: 当维度非 128 整除时 XLA 自动 zero-padding。对于 MoE 的小 expert（如 512 tokens）：512/128=4→无 padding，但每 tile 只有 4 个 128-token batch→MXU 在 token 维度的 utilization 仅 50%（128 tokens 宽但只有 4 行有用）","+"," ---"," ","-## 4. 不同硬件平台的 Tile 切分策略差异","+## 六、模型负载的 Kernel Tile 切分与并发"," ","-### 4.1 GPU SM Warp Scheduler 驱动的 Tile 级并发","+### 6.1 MoE Expert FFN Kernel Tiling"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 1262.8)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md` (score: 41.5)"," "," ```","-GPU SM 微架构对 Tile 并发的驱动:","+// Fused MoE Kernel (vLLM Triton, Mixtral-8x7B: 8 experts, top-k=2)","+// Grid: num_experts × ceil(num_tokens / BLOCK_M)","+// BLOCK_M = 64 (受 shared memory 约束)"," ","-SM 资源维度:","-  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-  │ Warp Scheduler × 4  (每 cycle 可 issue 1 指令/warp) │","-  │ Dispatch Unit × 4   (每 cycle 可 dispatch 1 warp)   │","-  │ Register File: 256 KB/SM (A100), 256 KB/SM (H100)  │","-  │ Shared Memory/L1: 164 KB/SM (A100), 228 KB/SM (H100)│","-  │ Tensor Core × 4    (A100 3rd gen, H100 4th gen)    │","-  │ Max Threads/SM: 2048                                 │","-  │ Max Blocks/SM: 32                                    │","-  │ Max Warps/SM: 64                                     │","-  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","+@triton.jit","+def fused_moe_kernel(A, B, C, sorted_token_ids, expert_ids, topk_weights, ...):","+    pid = tl.program_id(0)","+    expert_id = tl.load(expert_ids + pid)"," ","-ILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 trade-off:","-  ILP ↑  →  更多 register/thread → TLP ↓ (occupancy 降低)","-           eg: register=128/thread → max warps/SM = 256KB/(128×32×4B) ≈ 16 warps","-               register=64/thread  → max warps/SM = 256KB/(64×32×4B) ≈ 32 warps","+    // Step 1: Indirect token gather — 只加载当前 expert 的 tokens","+    token_indices = sorted_token_ids[pid*BLOCK_M : (pid+1)*BLOCK_M]","+    a_block = tl.load(A + token_indices[:,None] * H + range(H))  // [BLOCK_M, H]"," ","-  Intensity ↑ → 更大 tile → 更多 SMEM/block → TLP ↓","-           eg: SMEM=144KB/block → max blocks/SM = floor(164KB/144KB) = 1","-               SMEM=48KB/block  → max blocks/SM = floor(164KB/48KB) = 3","+    // Step 2: FC1 gate+up 融合 (单 GEMM, MMA tile 16×16×16)","+    w1 = tl.load(B + expert_id * stride_E)  // stacked [H, 2×ffn_dim]","+    gate = silu(tl.dot(a_block, w1_gate))    // [BLOCK_M, ffn_dim]","+    up   = tl.dot(a_block, w1_up)             // [BLOCK_M, ffn_dim]","+    hidden = gate * up                        // element-wise fused gating"," ","-  Infera 配置空间: 3 种 register × 4 种 SMEM × 3 种 pipeline = 36 种基础配置","+    // Step 3: FC2 down projection","+    w2 = tl.load(B + expert_id * stride_E + 2*ffn_dim*H)  // [ffn_dim, H]","+    expert_out = tl.dot(hidden, w2)           // [BLOCK_M, H]","+","+    // Step 4: Routing weight + atomic scatter-add","+    routing_w = tl.load(topk_weights + ...)   // [BLOCK_M]","+    expert_out = expert_out * routing_w[:, None]","+    tl.atomic_add(C + token_indices[:,None] * H + ..., expert_out)"," ```"," ","-**注解**: GPU SM 的 warp scheduler 通过零开销的 warp 切换隐藏延迟——当当前 warp stall（等待 global memory load 或 Tensor Core MMA 结果）时，scheduler 在下一个 cycle 立即切换到另一个就绪 warp。因此，SM occupancy（active warps/SM）越高，延迟隐藏能力越强。但 occupancy 与 register per thread 和 SMEM per block 形成零和博弈——更高的 ILP（更多 register）或更大的 tile（更多 SMEM）都会降低 occupancy。对于多算子/微算子并发场景，kernel 设计需要在 register tiling、shared memory tiling、warp-level parallelism 间找到平衡点——Infera 的 36 种配置覆盖三维 trade-off 空间并通过 online regression model 选择最优配置。","+**注解**:","+- **BLOCK_M 选择**: 受 SMEM 约束：需容纳 w1_gate_tile [H×ffn_dim_tile] + w1_up_tile + w2_tile + a_block [BLOCK_M×H] + hidden [BLOCK_M×ffn_dim]。H100 228KB SMEM 允许 BLOCK_M=64（H=4096, ffn_dim=14336 时）","+- **Indirect addressing**: `sorted_token_ids` 按 expert_id 排序——同一 expert 的 tokens 连续，最大化 L2 cache 命中","+- **Atomic scatter-add**: MoE top-k ≥ 2 时，同一 token 可能被多个 expert 处理——`atomic_add` 是 MoE kernel 的关键并发竞争点。H100 的 L2 atomic unit 处理 ~100M atomics/s"," ","----","+**MoE-SpeQ fuseMoE 的优化**（笔记补充）: 当每个 expert token 极少时（如 Qwen2-MoE draft 阶段 K=1408, N=2048），fuseMoE 将所有 expert 的 gate_proj+up_proj+SiLU+down_proj 融合为单 kernel launch，batch 多 expert 的 token hidden states 增大有效矩阵维度，提升 occupancy。消融显示 fused kernel 贡献 31.8% 加速（8.88→13.02 tok/s）。"," ","-### 4.2 NPU 达芬奇架构 Tile 约束","+### 6.2 DiT Attention + MLP Kernel Tiling"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910A NPU.md`","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused Sparse-Linear Attention GPU Kernel.md` (SLA kernel)"," ","+DiT (Diffusion Transformer) 的去噪 attention kernel 中，SLA 将稀疏 FlashAttention、线性 attention、negligible block skip 三种模式融合到单 kernel：","+"," ```","-Ascend 910A 达芬奇架构（基于笔记）:","-  - 32 AI Core / 芯片","-  - FP16: 320 TFLOPS, INT8: 640 TOPS","-  - HBM 带宽: 1.07 TB/s","-  - 片上互联: Mesh NoC, 256 GB/s 带宽","+// SLA Fused Forward Kernel (Algorithm 1)","+// Input: Q,K,V ∈ R^{N×d}, sparsity mask M_c ∈ {CRITICAL, MARGINAL, NEGLIGIBLE}"," ","-CANN 软件栈层次:","-  1. MindSpore / PyTorch (框架层)","-  2. CANN GE Engine (图编译和优化)","-  3. CANN Runtime + Driver (内存管理、AI Core/Vector Core 调度)","-  4. Ascend 910A 硬件","+// Tile 分配: Q 沿 BLOCK_Q rows per CTA; KV 沿 BLOCK_KV per iteration"," ","-关键硬件组件:","-  - Cube Unit: 矩阵乘法加速单元（类似 Tensor Core），用于 GEMM 计算","-  - Vector Unit: 向量计算单元，用于 activation/normalization/element-wise","-  - Scalar Unit: 标量计算单元，用于控制流和地址计算","-  - MTE (Memory Transfer Engine): 专用数据传输引擎，支持远程内存直接访问","+// Phase 1: Precompute for linear attention (所有 block 共享)","+h_j, z_j = precompute_linear_terms(K, V)  // per KV block","+","+// Phase 2: Per-Q-block loop（三种模式的条件执行）","+for each Q block i:","+    O_i, l_i, m_i = 0, 0, -inf","+    for each KV block j:","+        if M_c[i,j] == CRITICAL:","+            // 稀疏 FlashAttention: O(N²) Tensor Core MMA","+            S = Q_i @ K_j^T              // [BLOCK_Q, BLOCK_KV]","+            m_new = max(m_i, rowmax(S))","+            P = exp(S - m_new)","+            l_new = exp(m_i - m_new) * l_i + rowsum(P)","+            O_i = diag(exp(m_i - m_new)) @ O_i + P @ V_j","+        elif M_c[i,j] == MARGINAL:","+            // 线性注意力: O(1) via pre-aggregation, CUDA Core","+            H_i += h_j                   // d×d matrix addition","+            Z_i += z_j                   // d×1 vector addition","+        // else NEGLIGIBLE: skip","+    O_i = diag(1/l_i) @ O_i"," ```"," ","-**注解**: 笔记详细描述了 Ascend 910A 的宏观架构和 CANN 软件栈，但未提供 Cube Unit 的具体矩阵乘 tile 尺寸约束（如 GPU Tensor Core 的 16×16×16）。达芬奇架构的三单元分离设计（Cube/Vector/Scalar）天然支持多算子并发——GEMM 在 Cube Unit 上执行的同时，activation 在 Vector Unit 上执行，地址计算在 Scalar Unit 上执行，形成硬件级的指令并行。MTE 的远程内存访问能力（CoC 策略）使数据搬运与计算完全重叠（MTE 不占用 AI Core 计算资源）。但具体的 tile size 与 Cube Unit 尺寸的映射关系、Vector Unit 的向量化宽度（如 256-bit SIMD？）等细节，笔记未明确说明。","+**注解**:","+- **DiT tile 特殊性**: DiT 的 diffusion step 固定 latent resolution（如 64×64），所有 timestep 的 denoising 共享相同 shape——tile size 可静态配置（无 dynamic tiling 需求）","+- **MMA tile 利用率**: attention score 计算必须整除 16（FP16 MMA fragment）。BLOCK_Q 和 BLOCK_KV 的选择影响 Tensor Core occupancy——较大 BLOCK_KV 增加 MMA 计算密度但增加 SMEM footprint","+- **DiT 中 MLP/Conv 的 tile**: 笔记未提供 DiT MLP/Conv 的具体 tile 参数。DiT 的 MLP 类似标准 Transformer FFN，tile 策略与 MoE expert FFN 类似（沿 token 维 BLOCK_M × 沿 hidden 维 BLOCK_K）"," ","----","+### 6.3 Video Spatial-Temporal Attention Kernel Tiling"," ","-### 4.3 TPU MXU Systolic Array Tile 约束","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Open-Sora (DiT-based Video Generation Framework).md`"," ","-**笔记证据**: vault 中无 TPU v5e/v5p 的详细笔记。以下为可推断补充。","+Video DiT (Open-Sora) 的 kernel 算子序列包含 Spatial-Temporal Attention (STA) + Cross-Attention (CA) + FFN:"," ","-TPU 的 MXU（Matrix Multiply Unit）是 128×128 或 128×256 的脉动阵列（systolic array），其 tile 约束与 GPU 有本质区别：","-"," ```","-TPU MXU 对 Tile 形状的限制（可推断）:","+// Open-Sora (PixArt-α backbone) 的 Video DiT forward pass","+// B frames × H×W spatial tokens = B×HW total tokens"," ","-  MXU 尺寸:","-    TPU v3:     128×128 systolic array (BF16)","-    TPU v4:     128×128 (BF16/INT8)","-    TPU v5e/v5p: 128×128 或 128×256 (支持 FP8/INT8)","+// Step 1: Spatial-Temporal Attention (STA)","+//   1a. Spatial Self-Attention: 每帧内 HW tokens self-attention","+//       Q tile: [BLOCK_HW, d_head] 沿 spatial dim","+//       Grid: B × ceil(HW / BLOCK_HW)","+//   1b. Temporal Self-Attention: 每 spatial position T 帧 self-attention","+//       Q tile: [BLOCK_T, d_head] 沿 temporal dim","+//       Grid: HW × ceil(T / BLOCK_T)"," ","-  与 GPU 的本质差异:","-    GPU Tensor Core:  warp 级 MMA fragment (16×16×16) → 灵活的 tile 组合","-    TPU MXU:          chip 级 systolic array (128×128) → 严格的 tile shape 约束","+// Step 2: Cross-Attention (CA): text embedding 作为 KV","+//   Q tile: [BLOCK_HW, d_head]; KV: [text_len, d_head] (全常驻 SMEM)","+//   文本侧 KV 完全 fit shared memory（77 tokens × 768 × 2B ≈ 116KB）"," ","-  Tile 对齐要求:","-    - 矩阵乘的 K 维必须对齐 MXU 的 input dimension (128)","-    - 矩阵乘的 N 维受 MXU output dimension (128/256) 约束","-    - 非对齐 → 必须 padding，浪费计算和带宽","-    - 小 tile（如 MoE expert token 少 → M 维小）→ MXU 利用率低（大量 PE 空闲）","+// Step 3: FFN (类似 MoE FFN 的 gate+up+down 结构)","+//   tile: [BLOCK_TOKENS, hidden_dim] × [hidden_dim, ffn_dim]"," ```"," ","-**注解**: TPU 的 systolic array 与 GPU Tensor Core 的关键区别在于粒度——TPU MXU 是整个芯片级的固定尺寸脉动阵列，而 GPU Tensor Core 是 SM 内的可组合单元（多个 warp 可独立使用不同的 Tensor Core）。这意味着：(1) TPU 上 tile size 必须被 128/128×128 整除或至少对齐，否则利用率急剧下降；(2) MoE 的小 expert（token 少）场景下 TPU MXU 利用率必然低于 GPU（GPU 可以通过更多 warp 填充不同 expert 的 tile）；(3) TPU 的 tile 调度由 XLA 编译器在编译时静态确定，不支持 persistent kernel 的运行时动态调度。但笔记未提供 TPU 上 MoE/DiT 的具体 tile 调度实验数据。","+**注解**:","+- **Spatial vs Temporal Attention 的数据复用**: spatial attention 中每个 spatial position 的 KV 在 temporal attention 中被复用——适合通过 persistent kernel 将两个 attention 在 kernel 内顺序执行，KV 保持在 L2 cache","+- **3D Conv tile**: 笔记中的 Video DiT（Open-Sora）使用 attention-based backbone，3D Conv 主要在 VAE 编解码器中而非 DiT backbone——该链条节点无 Video DiT backbone 的 conv tile 笔记证据","+- **并发机会**: STA 中的 spatial attention 和 temporal attention 的 tile 无直接依赖——若使用 MPK-style mega-kernel，可在不同 SM 上并行执行"," ","----","+### 6.4 多模态 Cross-Attention Fusion Kernel Tiling"," ","-### 4.4 Groq LPU TSP、AMD MI300X CDNA3","+多模态模型（vision encoder + text encoder + cross-attention fusion）的 kernel tile 特征："," ","-**笔记证据**: vault 中无相关笔记。以下为简要可推断描述。","+```","+// 多模态 Cross-Attention Fusion: Q=vision[N_v,d], KV=text[N_t,d]","+// N_t 通常较小 (77-256 tokens) → KV 常驻 shared memory"," ","-- **Groq LPU (Tensor Streaming Processor)**：确定性架构，无 cache、无 shared memory、无动态调度——编译器在编译时静态确定所有数据移动和指令时序。Tile 切分由编译器在 compile time 完全确定，无运行时 tile 调度。笔记未提供 Groq 上 MoE/DiT kernel 的具体实现数据。","+// 非对称 tile 策略:","+//   Q tile: [BLOCK_V, d] 沿 vision token 维切分（可较大，vision token 多）","+//   KV tile: [N_t, d]    文本 KV 全部常驻 SMEM（无需沿 text 维切分）"," ","-- **AMD MI300X (CDNA3)**：使用 wavefront（64 线程，vs NVIDIA warp 32 线程）调度。CDNA3 的 Matrix Core 类似 NVIDIA Tensor Core 但 fragment size 和精度支持不同。ROCm/HIP 生态中的 tile 切分策略与 CUDA 概念相似（通过 composable_kernel 或类似 CUTLASS 的模板库）。笔记未提供 MI300X 上 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video kernel 的具体 tile 调度数据。","+// Shared memory 分配:","+//   K_text:  N_t × d × 2B ≈ 77 × 768 × 2 ≈ 116 KB (适合 H100 228KB)","+//   V_text:  N_t × d × 2B ≈ 116 KB","+//   Q_tile:  BLOCK_V × d × 2B ≈ 128 × 768 × 2 ≈ 192 KB","+//   总计 > 228KB → 需要 cycle over vision tokens with smaller BLOCK_V","+```"," ","+**注解**:","+- **笔记未明确说明**: 该节点无专门的多模态 cross-attention kernel 笔记。以上基于 attention tile 通用原理推断","+- **关键优化方向**: 文本 KV 常驻 SMEM（文本 token 少）→ 每个 Q tile 只需从 HBM 加载 vision tokens → asymmetric tiling（不对称 tile 切分）减少全局访存","+"," ---"," ","-## 5. 指令流水线视角：Tile 计算的时序编排","+## 七、跨平台 Tile 切分策略对比"," ","-### 5.1 GPU GEMM Kernel 的 Software Pipelining 时序","+### 7.1 硬件平台 Tile 约束汇总"," ","-```","-GEMM Tile 计算的指令流水线时序（Hopper + TMA）:","-时间 →","+| 硬件平台 | MMA/矩阵单元 | Tile 对齐约束 | SM/Core 资源 | 调度粒度 | 并发模型 |","+|----------|-------------|--------------|-------------|----------|----------|","+| **NVIDIA H100** | 4th-gen TC, mma 16×8×16 FP16 | M/N/K 整除 16 | 228KB SMEM/SM, 256KB RF | Warp Scheduler ×4/SM | SIMT + warp-level MMA + TMA async |","+| **NVIDIA A100** | 3rd-gen TC, mma 16×8×8 FP16 | M/N/K 整除 16 | 164KB SMEM/SM, 256KB RF | Warp Scheduler ×4/SM | SIMT + cp.async + warp-level MMA |","+| **Ascend 910B** | Cube Unit (脉动阵列) | 笔记未标具体尺寸 | 20 AI Cores, 多级 L0/L1 buffer | AI Core 级粗粒度 | Cube+Vector+Scalar 异构并发 |","+| **TPU v5p** | MXU 128×128 (/128×256) | 严格对齐 128 | 1 MXU/chip, VPU memory ~16MB | XLA 编译期静态 | 单 tile systolic wave |","+| **AMD MI300X** | CDNA3 Matrix Core | 笔记未覆盖 | 每 SIMD 512 reg | Wavefront (64 threads) | Wave-level; 无 producer-consumer 优势 |","+| **Groq LPU** | TSP (deterministic) | 编译时固定 | 片上 SRAM (~230MB) | Compiler 确定性调度 | 数据流: 指令级编排 |"," ","-Producer Warp (TMA async copy):  Consumer Warp (MMA compute):","-T0:  cp.async.bulk K₀: global→SMEM   │","-T1:  cp.async.bulk K₁: global→SMEM   │  (等待 K₀ 完成)","-T2:  cp.async.bulk K₂: global→SMEM   │  mma.sync K₀: SMEM→RF→Acc","-T3:  cp.async.bulk K₃: global→SMEM   │  mma.sync K₀ (continued)","-T4:  cp.async.bulk K₀': global→SMEM  │  mma.sync K₁: SMEM→RF→Acc","-     (下一 tile 的 K₀)                │","-T5:  cp.async.bulk K₁': global→SMEM  │  mma.sync K₁ (continued)","-...","+### 7.2 关键差异"," ","-Pipeline depth: 2 stages (load | compute)","-Overlap: TMA load 与 MMA compute 完全并发","-         (TMA 使用独立硬件单元，不占用 SM 的 warp scheduler/ALU/Tensor Core)","-```","+**GPU vs NPU**:","+- GPU warp scheduler 动态切换 warp 隐藏延迟（~300-800 cycle memory latency 被多 warp 交错隐藏）；NPU Cube Unit 是同步脉动阵列——延迟固定，tile 需在编译期匹配 pipelining depth","+- NPU 的 Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元分离提供天然的微算子并发——GEMM（Cube）与 activation（Vector）可同时执行；GPU 需通过 warp specialization 在软件层模拟（producer-consumer warp 分工）"," ","-**注解**: Hopper TMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）是 GPU 上一个重要的硬件创新——它将 global→shared memory 的数据搬运从 SM 的计算流水线中分离出来。TMA 执行 `cp.async.bulk` 时，SM 的 warp scheduler 可以调度 consumer warp 执行 MMA 指令，实现了 load 和 compute 的完全重叠。在 Ampere 架构上，相同功能需要 SM 的 load/store 单元执行 `cp.async`（shared memory copy），仍消耗 SM 的部分资源。这解释了为什么 HyTiS 在 Hopper 上使用 persistent kernel + TMA 而在 Ampere 上不用——Ampere 缺少硬件 TMA 支持导致 persistent kernel 的 register 压力过大。","+**GPU vs TPU**:","+- GPU 可组合 16×16 MMA tile 构建任意 tile shape；TPU MXU 128×128 不可拆分——tile 必须为 128 的倍数","+- GPU 适合 MoE（小 expert 细分 tile）；TPU 适合密集 Transformer（大 GEMM 填满 128×128 MXU）"," ","+**NVIDIA vs AMD** (笔记证据: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wave Specialization (Producer-Consumer) on AMD.md`):","+- AMD CDNA3 静态寄存器分配：每 SIMD 512 regs 在所有 wave 间平均分配，producer wave 占用 register 但 consumer 无法回收 → 缩小 output tile size","+- AMD 无 TMA/wgmma/mbarrier → producer-consumer 性能退化（4P+8C: 893 TFLOPS vs 0P+8C: 1281 TFLOPS）","+- 推荐 8-WAVE PING-PONG（无专职 producer）替代 producer-consumer","+"," ---"," ","-## 6. 方法对比表","+## 八、方法对比总表"," ","-| 方法 | 核心机制 | Tile 配置 | 硬件平台 | 并发支持 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|-----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| **CUTLASS** | 层次化 tile 分解 (Thread→Warp→CTA→Kernel) | MMA 16×16×16, WarpShape 64×64, CTA 128×128 | NVIDIA GPU (Volta→Blackwell) | warp-level MMA + shared memory tile 共享 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA CUTLASS.md (6976.0) |","-| **FlashMoE** | Single persistent kernel + actor model | tile (128,64), block=128, reg=255, 2 blocks/SM | H100/A100 (NVLink + NVSHMEM) | Processor/Scheduler/Subscriber actor 并发 | Megakernel note (4211.2) + FlashMoE paper (1347.6) |","-| **FlashAttention** | SRAM-bounded tiling + online softmax | B_c=384, B_r=64 (A100, d=64) | A100/H100 | outer/inner loop tile pipeline | Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel note |","-| **WELDER** | 硬件对齐 tile shape 搜索 (3 penalties) | 自动搜索, MMA 整除约束 | V100 (SM 约束) | 多 operator 图级 tile 调度 | Hardware-Aligned Tile Search note (2897.4) |","-| **HyTiS** | Tile layout scheduling (GM/GN) + wave utilization | 动态 group-M/N 选择 | H100 (persistent+TMA) / A100 (传统) | wave-level tile 并发 | HyTiS paper (2988.0) |","-| **MegaScale-MoE** | 4 类 tile 级 fused kernel (A2A+GEMM 等) | tile 大小与通信粒度对齐 | NVIDIA GPU (NCCL + NVLink) | SM 分区 + device memory barrier tile 同步 | Intra-operator Overlap note (5519.8) |","-| **MPK (Mirage)** | SM 级 tGraph 自动编译 | 按 SM 数和数据依赖自动分区 | NVIDIA GPU | SM-task 级跨算子并发 (MatMul+AllReduce) | MPK paper (3408.0) |","-| **GroupGEMM** | 多 expert GEMM 批量执行 | TILE_M/N/K 由 CUTLASS 确定 | H100 (TMA) / A100 (cp.async) | expert 间 tile 交错调度 | GroupGEMM note (8906.1) |","-| **Ascend CANN/TBE** | Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元分离 | 笔记未明确 Cube Unit tile 尺寸 | Ascend 910A/910B/310P | Cube+Vector+Scalar 硬件并发 + MTE 数据搬运 | Ascend 910A note + CANN note |","-| **TPU XLA** | 128×128/128×256 MXU systolic array | 严格对齐 128 的倍数 | TPU v3/v4/v5e/v5p | 编译时静态调度 | vault 无详细笔记 (可推断) |","-| **Groq Compiler** | 确定性编译时调度 (无 cache/SMEM) | 编译时完全确定 | Groq LPU (TSP) | 确定性指令级编排 | vault 无详细笔记 |","-| **AMD MI300X ROCm** | CDNA3 Matrix Core + wavefront (64) | 类似 CUTLASS 的模板库 (composable_kernel) | MI300X (CDNA3) | wavefront-level 并发 | vault 无详细笔记 |","+| 方法 | 核心机制 | 硬件平台 | Tile 配置 | 调度机制 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|----------|----------|-----------|----------|----------|----------|","+| WELDER tile search | 三级硬件 penalty tile 枚举 | V100 | 自动搜索 + MMA 整除约束 | SubGraphTiling (编译期) | adjusted MemTraffic | WELDER (3808) |","+| ThunderKittens LCSF | 16×16 warp tile + multi-stage async | H100/A100 | N-stage buffer (1-4); swizzle layout | Persistent grid + block order {8,N,M/8} | GEMM 760 TFLOPS (4-stage) | TK (2901) |","+| Mirage Persistent Kernel | SM 级 tGraph → mega-kernel | NVIDIA GPU | Per-SM task 按 output 维 partition | Event-driven decentralized (BFS linear) | up to 1.7× latency reduction | MPK (4149) |","+| FlashMoE | Single persistent kernel + actor model | H100/A100 | tile (128,64), 128 threads, 255 regs | Processor/Scheduler/Subscriber actor | 93.17% SM utilization | FlashMoE note |","+| Fused MoE (vLLM) | Expert FFN GEMM+Gate+Reduce fused | H100 | BLOCK_M=64, sorted indirection | Triton block-level + atomic scatter-add | 15-20% throughput | Fused MoE (41.5) |","+| SLA Fused Attention | Sparse+Linear+Skip 三模式融合 | NVIDIA GPU | BLOCK_Q × BLOCK_KV per mask | 单 kernel conditional per-block | 13.7× vs FA2 (kernel-only) | SLA Kernel |","+| GroupGEMM (Comet) | 按 remote dependency 重排序 tile | H100 (TMA) | TILE_M/N/K per CUTLASS | 重排序 + producer-consumer TMA pipeline | — | GroupGEMM note |","+| Ascend TBE/TIK MoE | Cube+Vector+Scalar 异构 tile | Ascend 910B | Cube 16×16 (推测) + Vector SIMD | AI Core 级粗粒度 tile + MTE overlap | 笔记未提供 benchmark | Ascend 910 note |","+| XLA TPU | MXU 128×128 systolic | TPU v5e/v5p | 强制对齐 128 | XLA 编译期静态（GemmFusion pass） | 笔记未提供 benchmark | 无 note evidence |","+| AMD wave-level | 8-WAVE PING-PONG | MI300X CDNA3 | 静态 reg 分配 512/SIMD | Wavefront-level w/o producer-consumer | 0P+8C: 1281 TFLOPS | Wave Spec note |"," "," ---"," ","-## 7. 不确定性","+## 九、不确定性"," ","-1. **TPU v5e/v5p MXU tile 约束**：vault 中无 TPU 脉动阵列的详细笔记，128×128/128×256 尺寸和 tile 对齐要求为可推断（基于 TPU 公开文档）。","-2. **Groq LPU TSP**：vault 中无 Groq 架构笔记，确定性编译时调度描述为可推断。","-3. **AMD MI300X CDNA3**：vault 中无 AMD GPU 的 tile 切分笔记。","-4. **NPU Cube Unit tile 尺寸**：笔记描述了 Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元分离架构，但未提供 Cube Unit 的具体矩阵乘 tile 约束（如 GPU MMA 的 16×16×16）。","-5. **DiT / 多模态 / Video kernel 具体 tile 参数**：vault 笔记主要集中在 MoE 和通用 GPU attention kernel 的 tiling（FlashAttention、FlashMoE、GroupGEMM），缺少 DiT diffusion denoising kernel（attention+MLP 子 kernel）、多模态 cross-attention fusion kernel、Video spatial-temporal + 3D conv kernel 的特定 tile 切分参数和调度策略的详细笔记。","-6. **Grid-stride loop 与 Cooperative Groups**：vault 中未找到详细实现笔记，仅可推断标准 CUDA 编程范式。","-7. **Dynamic Parallelism 的 MoE 场景实验数据**：笔记仅提及 CDP 概念，无基于 MoE/DiT 场景的具体 benchmark 数据。","+1. **TPU MXU 精确参数**: vault 中无 TPU 微架构专用笔记，MXU 128×128 约束基于公开文档推断。XLA 的 tile 自动推导逻辑和 VPU memory 具体容量未在笔记证据中覆盖","+2. **Ascend Cube Unit 尺寸**: 笔记确认达芬奇架构的三单元分离设计，但未提供 Cube Unit MAC array 具体维度、Vector Unit 向量化宽度、L0/L1 buffer 容量和带宽","+3. **Groq LPU**: vault 中无 Groq TSP 架构笔记，确定性编译时调度的 tile 约束未覆盖","+4. **AMD MI300X CDNA3**: vault 中无 AMD tile 切分的详细笔记，仅 wave specialization 退化分析（来自 HipKittens 论文的二手引用）","+5. **DiT attention+MLP tile 参数**: vault 笔记以 SLA 的 fused attention 为主，DiT MLP/conv 的特定 tile shape 参数未独立记录","+6. **Video 3D Conv kernel tiling**: Video DiT 以 attention-based backbone 为主（Open-Sora PixArt-α），3D Conv 主要在 VAE 中，相关 tile 策略笔记未覆盖","+7. **多模态 cross-attention fusion tile**: vault 无专用笔记，以上基于 attention tile 通用原理推断","+8. **Dynamic parallelism 实验数据**: 笔记仅提及 CDP 概念，无 MoE/DiT 场景的 per-expert dynamic launch benchmark"," "," ---"," ","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L4-Q4.1","+## 十、所用上下文 vault path 来源","+","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` — tile shape 硬件惩罚枚举算法","+- `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` — ILP/TLP/Intensity 三维 trade-off 模型","+- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens Simple, Fast, and Adorable Kernels/span-idpage-4-0span3-THUNDERKITTENS.md` — warp tile/LCSF/persistent grid/block order","+- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` — tGraph/mega-kernel/SM 级任务调度","+- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Task-Based Tensor Computations on Modern GPUs/Task-Based-Tensor-Computations-on-Modern-GPUs.md` — Cypress task-based/warp-specialization","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md` — MoE expert FFN fused kernel 伪代码","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block Order Scheduling _ L2 Cache Reuse (GPU).md` — block order 对 L2 cache 的影响","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Wave Specialization (Producer-Consumer) on AMD.md` — AMD CDNA wave-spec 退化","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910 AI Accelerator（昇腾910 AI加速器）.md` — Ascend 910B Da Vinci","+- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Huawei Ascend 910B3 NPU.md` — Ascend 910B3 规格","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused Sparse-Linear Attention GPU Kernel.md` — DiT SLA fused attention kernel","+- `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Video Diffusion Transformer (V-DM _ VDiT).md` — VDiT 架构","+- `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Open-Sora (DiT-based Video Generation Framework).md` — Video DiT 生成框架","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Framework Scheduling Overhead.md` — kernel launch overhead 分析","+- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA Graph.md` — CUDA Graph 并发机制","+- `paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT Accelerating LLM Decoding via Prefix-Aware Attention with Resource Efficient Multi-Tile Kernel/` — multi-tile kernel CTA concurrency","+","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q4.1"]}],"originalFile":"# Q4.1 — Kernel Tile 切分与调度策略：多算子/微算子并发下的硬件体系结构分析\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA CUTLASS.md | 6976.0 | CUTLASS 层次化 tile 分解、MMA tile、warp tile、device-side GEMM |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md | 4211.2 | FlashMoE persistent kernel 架构、tile 维度选择、SM occupancy |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md | — | FlashAttention tiling scheme、block size 公式、SRAM budget 分析 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md | 2897.4 | 硬件对齐 tile 搜索、uncoalesced access penalty、parallelism penalty |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE).md | 8906.1 | MoE GroupGEMM tile 调度、Hopper TMA、动态 GEMM 选择 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels.md | 5519.8 | Tile 级通信-计算融合 kernel、SM 分配与 swizzling |\n| paper_secs/.../FlashMoE Fast Distributed MoE in a Single Kernel/1-Introduction.md | 1347.6 | FlashMoE single-kernel 设计、tile 维度 (128,64)、actor model |\n| paper_secs/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md | 3408.0 | MPK tGraph SM 级表示、task/event 依赖、mega-kernel 编译 |\n| paper_secs/.../HyTiS.../span-idpage-6-0span3.3-Tile-Layout-Scheduling.md | 2988.0 | HyTiS tile layout scheduling、group-M vs group-N、Hopper vs Ampere |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910A NPU.md | — | Ascend 910A 达芬奇架构、AI Core、HBM、CANN 软件栈 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md | 1262.8 | ILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 trade-off、register tiling |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Group GEMM for MoE Inference.md | 7313.5 | Group GEMM tile 分配、dynamic expert activation pattern |\n\n**注意**：vault 中无 TPU v5e/v5p MXU 128×128/128×256 systolic array tile 约束、Groq LPU TSP、AMD MI300X CDNA3 的详细笔记。以下对这些平台的讨论标注为「可推断」或「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n---\n\n## 1. GPU（NVIDIA H100/A100）Tile 切分策略\n\n### 1.1 CUTLASS 层次化 Tile 分解模型\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA CUTLASS.md` (score: 6976.0)\n\nCUTLASS 将 GEMM 计算分解为严格的层次化 tile 结构，从最细到最粗粒度依次为：\n\n```\n层次化 Tile 分解（自上而下）:\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Device 级: Grid = (M/M_tile, N/N_tile) 个 CTA       │\n│ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│ │ Thread Block (CTA) 级: M_tile × N_tile           │ │\n│ │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │ │\n│ │ │ Warp 级: WarpShape (如 64×64), 每 warp 32 线程│ │ │\n│ │ │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐ │ │ │\n│ │ │ │ Thread 级: MMA fragment (如 16×16×16)    │ │ │ │\n│ │ │ │ Tensor Core 单指令处理一个 fragment       │ │ │ │\n│ │ │ └────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │ │\n│ │ └────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │\n│ └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**MMA Tile 形状与精度对应**（可推断 + 笔记证据）:\n\n| 精度 | MMA 指令形状 (M×N×K) | Tensor Core 代数 | 适用架构 |\n|------|----------------------|-------------------|----------|\n| FP16 | 16×16×16 | Volta/Turing | V100, T4 |\n| FP16 | 16×8×16 | Ampere | A100 |\n| TF32 | 16×8×8 | Ampere | A100 |\n| FP8 | 16×16×32 | Hopper (4th gen) | H100 |\n| INT8 | 32×16×16 | Turing+ | T4, A100, H100 |\n\n**注解**: CUTLASS 的 tile 层次设计直接映射到 GPU SM 微架构的物理资源层级：MMA fragment 映射到 Tensor Core 的一次矩阵乘加操作（每个 warp 在一个 cycle 内提交一条 `mma.sync` 指令）；Warp Tile 对应一个 warp 在 shared memory 中持有的数据窗口（数据复用窗口大小 = 计算量 / 访存量）；Thread Block Tile 通过 shared memory 实现 block 内所有 warp 间的数据共享；Grid 将整个输出矩阵按 tile 划分到各 SM 上并行执行。CUTLASS 3.x 的 CuTe 库提供多维线程/数据布局抽象，使得 tile 迭代器（TileIterator）和 Collective 可以实现 warp-specialized 数据流水线（producer warp 通过 TMA 加载、consumer warp 执行 MMA）。\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 FlashMoE Persistent Kernel 的 Tile 设计与 SM 映射\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 4211.2)；`paper_secs/.../FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 1347.6)\n\nFlashMoE 是首个将分布式 MoE 全部操作融合为单一 persistent kernel 的工作。其 tile 维度和 SM 映射策略如下：\n\n```\nFlashMoE tile 配置（通过 parameter sweep 确定）:\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ tile 维度:     (128, 64)                     │\n│ block_size:    128 threads/block             │\n│ registers:     255/thread (max, 0 spill)     │\n│ SMEM:          46 KB/block                   │\n│ blocks/SM:     max 2 (受限于 register/SMEM)   │\n│ Grid:          N blocks/GPU                  │\n│                                               │\n│ 角色分配:                                      │\n│   blockId < N-1:  Processor (执行 GEMM 计算)   │\n│   blockId = N-1:   OS block                   │\n│     warp 0:        Scheduler (任务调度)        │\n│     warp 1-3:      Subscriber (解码远程 tile)  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**tile 维度选择的关键洞察**（笔记原文总结）：\n1. 增大 tile width（N 维）会显著提高每线程 register 使用量，触发 register spill 到 local memory（性能灾难）\n2. 增大 tile height（M 维）但不增加线程数，使每线程工作量增加，降低并行度\n3. 增加 block 线程数 > 128 会减少每 SM 并发 block 数，降低 SM occupancy\n4. 更大 block size 增加 `__syncthreads()` barrier 开销\n\n**注解**: tile 维度 (128, 64) 是 FlashMoE 在 A100/H100 上经 exhaustive parameter sweep 后的最优解。M=128 沿 token batch 维度切分，N=64 沿 FFN intermediate 维度切分。该配置在 register 使用（255 寄存器/线程接近 A100 的 256KB/SM 上限）和 SM occupancy（2 blocks/SM）间取得平衡。每个 Processor block 内部使用 CUTLASS device-side API 执行 fused GEMM0 (A×W₁→GELU→+bias) + GEMM1 (C₁×W₂→identity)，消除了退出 kernel 和重新 launch 的开销。\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 FlashAttention Tiling Scheme：SRAM-Bounded Tile Size 推导\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md`\n\nFlashAttention 是 tiling 策略在 attention kernel 中的经典应用。其 tile size 选择由 SRAM 容量直接决定：\n\n```\nFlashAttention tile 分块参数（A100, d=64, FP16, M=192KB SRAM）:\n\nB_c = ⌈M / (4d)⌉ = ⌈192×1024 / (4×64×2)⌉ ≈ 384   (KV block size, 沿序列维度)\nB_r = min(B_c, d) = min(384, 64) = 64               (Q block size, 沿序列维度)\n\n每 block pair (i,j) 的 SRAM 分配:\n  K_j tile:  B_c × d × 2B = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB\n  V_j tile:  B_c × d × 2B = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB\n  Q_i tile:  B_r × d × 2B = 64  × 64 × 2 =  8,192 B ≈  8 KB\n  S_ij/P_ij: B_r × B_c × 2B = 64 × 384 × 2 = 49,152 B ≈ 49 KB\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  Total: 49+49+8+49 = 155 KB ≤ 192 KB SRAM ✓\n```\n\n**HBM 访问量对比**（forward pass, N=1024, d=64）:\n- Standard attention: ~8.5 MB（Q/K/V 各 128KB + S/P 中间矩阵多次读写）\n- FlashAttention tiling: ~552 KB（约 15× 减少）\n\n**注解**: FlashAttention 的 tiling 设计揭示了 GPU kernel tiling 的核心约束——tile 必须 fit 在 on-chip SRAM（shared memory + L1）中，且需要在 tile size 和 SM occupancy 间权衡。更大的 B_c 减少 HBM passes 但增加 SRAM per block → 降低每 SM 并发 block 数。消融实验（Figure 2 middle）表明 B_c≥256 后进入 compute-bound regime。H100 的 228KB/SM（vs A100 164KB/SM）提供了更大的 tile size 空间。tile 形状还受 Tensor Core MMA fragment（16×16×16）对齐约束——B_r 和 B_c 必须是 16 的倍数才能高效利用 Tensor Core。\n\n---\n\n### 1.4 WELDER：硬件对齐的 Tile Shape 搜索\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` (score: 2897.4)\n\nWELDER 在 tile shape 枚举时通过三个硬件感知 penalty 引导搜索：\n\n```\nEnumerateSubtiles with hardware penalties（伪代码）:\n\nfor axis in output_axes:\n  tile = init_tile  // 从最小合法 tile 开始\n  while tile[axis] < tensor_dim[axis]:\n    tile[axis] = expand_toward_hardware_alignment(tile[axis])\n\n    // Penalty 1: Uncoalesced Memory Access\n    // CUDA GPU: 128B per transaction (32 × FP32 elements)\n    if not is_coalesced(tile, transaction_width=128B):\n      extra_traffic = calculate_extra_transactions(tile)\n\n    // Penalty 2: Parallelism\n    // V100: 80 SMs × 4 warp schedulers × 32 threads → min 128 parallelism\n    num_parallel_tiles = total_elements / tile_size\n    if num_parallel_tiles < hardware_parallelism:\n      extra_traffic *= (hardware_parallelism / num_parallel_tiles)\n\n    // Penalty 3: Capacity (infinite penalty → 直接淘汰)\n    footprint = MemFootprint(graph_with_tile_config)\n    if footprint > target_memory_capacity: continue\n\n    // MMA fragment 整除约束\n    for axis marked as MMA_axis:\n      enforce_tile[axis] % MMA_fragment_size == 0  // e.g., 16 for FP16\n\n    configs.push(tile_config, priority=adjusted_traffic)\n```\n\n**注解**: WELDER 的硬件对齐策略体现了 tile shape 搜索的三个核心约束：(1) **访存对齐**——global memory 的合并访问需要 128B 对齐（32 个 FP32），tile 的 leading dimension 若不是 32 的倍数会导致非合并访问，每个线程需要多个 memory transaction；(2) **并行度约束**——tile 数量必须 ≥ 硬件最小并行度（80 SMs × 每个 SM 的 warp slots），否则部分 SM 空闲；(3) **容量约束**——tile 的 memory footprint 超过 shared memory/register file 容量直接淘汰。对于 Tensor Core，额外施加 MMA fragment size 整除约束（FP16: 16, INT8: 32），确保 tile 能映射到完整的 MMA 指令。\n\n---\n\n### 1.5 HyTiS：Tile Layout Scheduling 与 Wave Utilization\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../HyTiS.../span-idpage-6-0span3.3-Tile-Layout-Scheduling.md` (score: 2988.0)\n\nHyTiS 在确定 tile size 后进一步优化 tile layout——两种基础模式：\n\n```\nTile Layout 模式:\n  group-M (GM): 沿 M 维分组 tile，每组内沿 N 维连续\n  group-N (GN): 沿 N 维分组 tile，每组内沿 M 维连续\n\nHopper vs Ampere 策略差异:\n  - Hopper (H100): 使用 persistent kernel + TMA 指令加速 global memory 加载\n  - Ampere (A100): 不用 persistent kernel（register 使用过高），\n                    不用 TMA 指令（不支持），采用传统 kernel 调度\n```\n\n**注解**: HyTiS 揭示了 tile layout 对 GPU wave utilization 和 L2 cache locality 的影响。在 Hopper 架构上，persistent kernel 消除 CTA launch overhead，TMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）通过异步 bulk copy（`cp.async.bulk`）实现高效的 global→shared 数据传输，同时 TMA 的硬件地址计算减轻了 SM 的地址生成压力。而在 Ampere 上，persistent kernel 的 register 开销过高（因为需要 while-loop 控制流和全局状态跟踪），因此传统多-wave kernel launch 更高效——这体现了硬件架构对调度策略的根本性影响。\n\n---\n\n## 2. Kernel 调度机制\n\n### 2.1 Persistent Kernel（持久化 Kernel）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 4211.2)\n\nPersistent kernel 的核心思想：一次 launch 后持续运行，kernel 内部通过 while-loop 轮询新任务，直到所有工作完成才 return。与传统 kernel-per-operator 模式的对比：\n\n```\n传统模式 (kernel-per-operator):\n  CPU: launch(GEMM0) → wait → launch(GELU) → wait → launch(GEMM1) → wait → ...\n  GPU: execute → idle → execute → idle → execute → idle → ...\n  问题: CPU-GPU sync overhead, kernel launch overhead, GPU idle gaps\n\nPersistent Kernel 模式:\n  CPU: launch(megakernel) ──────────────────────→ (单次 launch)\n  GPU: while(!all_done):\n         task = scheduler.get_next_task()\n         switch(task.type):\n           case GEMM0:  CUTLASS_device_GEMM(...); break\n           case GEMM1:  CUTLASS_device_GEMM(...); break\n           case COMM:   NVSHMEM_put(...); break\n         notify_scheduler()\n```\n\n**FlashMoE Persistent Kernel 伪代码**（基于笔记重构）:\n\n```cuda\n// 输入: A[S×H]=输入token矩阵, O[S×H]=输出矩阵, X[E×H×D]=expert权重, N=blocks/GPU\n// Grid: N blocks, Block: 128 threads\n__global__ void flashmoe_megakernel(A, O, X, N) {\n    // ===== Phase 1: Fused Gate (所有 block 参与) =====\n    T_phi, G_phi = FusedGate(A);  // routing table + affinity scores\n\n    __syncthreads();  // 全局 barrier\n\n    // ===== Phase 2: 角色分工 =====\n    if (blockId < N - 1) {\n        // === Processor 角色: 执行计算任务 ===\n        Dispatch(T_phi, A);  // 发送 token tile 到目标 GPU\n\n        while (!interrupt) {\n            task = poll_global_memory_doorbell();  // 等待 Scheduler 分配任务\n            if (task == NO_TASK) continue;          // spin-wait\n\n            switch (task.type) {\n                case GEMM0:\n                    // CUTLASS device-side fused GEMM: A×W1 → GELU → +bias\n                    // tile shape: (128, 64), registers=255/thread\n                    CUTLASS_device_fused_GEMM0(task.input, task.weight, task.output);\n                    notify_scheduler(task.done_flag);\n                    break;\n\n                case GEMM1:\n                    // CUTLASS device-side GEMM: C1×W2 → identity epilogue\n                    CUTLASS_device_GEMM1(task.input, task.weight, task.output);\n                    // 通过 NVSHMEM 将结果 put 到目标 GPU 的 combine buffer\n                    NVSHMEM_put(task.output, remote_combine_buffer[task.target_gpu],\n                                task.size, task.target_pe);\n                    notify_subscriber(task.done_flag);\n                    break;\n\n                case COMBINE:\n                    // expert-combine: 加权合并多 expert 输出\n                    combine_weighted(task.input, task.affinity_weights, task.output);\n                    break;\n            }\n        }\n\n    } else {\n        // === OS Block (blockId == N-1) ===\n        if (warpID == 0) {\n            // Scheduler Warp: 多线程任务调度\n            while (!all_done) {\n                // 扫描 doorbell 获取就绪任务\n                ready_tasks = sweep_doorbells();\n                // WarpInclusiveSum 计算就绪任务总数\n                total_ready = WarpInclusiveSum(ready_tasks.count);\n                // 将就绪任务分配给空闲 Processor\n                assign_tasks_to_idle_processors(ready_tasks);\n            }\n        } else {\n            // Subscriber Warps (warp 1-3): 解码远程 tile\n            while (!all_done) {\n                // Poll remote GPU 发来的 tile packet flags\n                remote_tile = poll_remote_flags();\n                if (remote_tile.ready) {\n                    task_desc = decode_tile_to_task(remote_tile, T_phi, G_phi);\n                    enqueue_task(task_desc);  // 放入 Scheduler 队列\n                    signal_scheduler_doorbell();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**注解**: Persistent kernel 的核心优势：(1) 消除 kernel launch overhead——FlashMoE 仅 1 次 launch vs baseline 33-550 次（Table 1）；(2) 在 kernel 内实现 work-conserving 调度——Scheduler 持续扫描就绪任务并分配，避免 SM 空闲；(3) device-side BLAS（CUTLASS device API）在 kernel 内执行完整 GEMM，无需退出 kernel；(4) 通过 NVSHMEM 实现 kernel 内跨 GPU 通信。代价：(a) register 开销大（需维护全局状态、while-loop 控制流、任务队列），在 register-poor 架构（如 Ampere 的 persistent kernel，笔记提到 \"persistent kernels incur excessive register file usage\" on Ampere）上反而降低 occupancy；(b) 工程复杂度极高（FlashMoE 6820 行 CUDA/C++）。FlashMoE 实测达到 93.17% SM utilization（vs baseline 9.67-59.11%）。\n\n---\n\n### 2.2 Grid-Stride Loop（栅格跨步循环）\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未详细说明 grid-stride loop 实现细节。以下基于可推断的 CUDA 编程范式补充。\n\nGrid-stride loop 是一种经典的 CUDA 编程模式，允许单个 thread block 处理多个 tile，通过跨步（stride = gridDim）迭代覆盖超过 grid 数量的数据块：\n\n```cuda\n// Grid-stride loop 模式（可推断）:\n// Grid: G blocks, 每个 block 处理 data_size / (G × block_size) 个 tile\n__global__ void grid_stride_kernel(float* data, int N) {\n    int tid = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;\n    int stride = blockDim.x * gridDim.x;  // grid-stride\n\n    // 每个线程处理多个元素（跨步迭代）\n    for (int i = tid; i < N; i += stride) {\n        // 计算逻辑\n        data[i] = f(data[i]);\n    }\n}\n\n// 应用于 tile 调度:\n// Grid: G_SM × N_blocks_per_SM 个 CTA\n// 每个 CTA 通过 grid-stride 处理 ceil(total_tiles / G_SM) 个 tile\n```\n\n**注解**: Grid-stride loop 的优势是灵活——grid size 可以固定（如 = SM 数量 × max blocks/SM），不依赖输入大小，特别适合 persistent kernel 的替代方案。与 persistent kernel 的区别：grid-stride loop 中所有 CTA 独立并行、无显式同步；persistent kernel 中 CTA 通过全局 flags/doorbells 协同、有中心化调度器。对于 MoE 场景，当 expert 数量多但每个 expert token 少时，grid-stride 允许每个 CTA 处理多个小 expert 的 tile，避免 CTA 数量不足导致的负载不均。\n\n---\n\n### 2.3 Dynamic Parallelism（动态并行）\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../87-Automated End-to-End Model Serving.../span-idpage-8-0span5.4-Execute-Tasks.md` (score: 645.5)\n\n笔记显示存在一个 \"daemon kernel\" 使用 CUDA Dynamic Parallelism (CDP) 在 device 端直接 launch kernel：\n\n```\nDevice-side kernel launch（基于笔记描述）:\n  - GPU 上运行一个 persistent \"daemon kernel\"\n  - daemon kernel 利用 cudaLaunchDevice() 在 GPU 端直接 launch 子 kernel\n  - \"Fire-and-forget\" 启动模式：子 kernel 由 GPU 硬件调度器立即调度\n  - 消除 CPU→GPU kernel launch 延迟\n```\n\n**注解**: Dynamic parallelism 允许 GPU kernel 在运行时根据数据条件动态 launch 新的子 kernel。在 MoE 场景中特别有用——可以根据 gating 结果动态决定需要执行哪些 expert kernel，避免 CPU 端的 round-trip。但 CDP 有显著开销：(1) 每次 device-side launch 有 ~5-10μs 延迟（远小于 CPU launch 的 ~10-20μs，但仍是 persistent kernel 的额外开销）；(2) 子 kernel 的 grid/block 维度在 launch 时确定，不支持 persistent kernel 的 work-conserving 动态调度；(3) CDP 与 CUDA Graph 不兼容。笔记未提供 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 场景下 CDP 的详细实验数据。\n\n---\n\n### 2.4 Cooperative Groups\n\n**笔记证据**: 笔记未详细说明 cooperative groups。以下为可推断补充。\n\nCooperative Groups 是 CUDA 9+ 引入的编程模型，允许在 kernel 内进行跨 warp/跨 block 的细粒度同步。与传统的 `__syncthreads()`（仅同步 block 内线程）相比，`cooperative_groups::grid_group::sync()` 可以实现跨整个 grid 的同步。在 MoE persistent kernel 中可用于 expert barrier（所有 Processor 完成当前 expert 的 GEMM 后再切换到下一个 expert），但 grid-level sync 代价高（需要所有 block 同时到达 barrier 点），实际系统中更倾向于使用 doorbell/flag 机制（如 FlashMoE 的设计）。\n\n---\n\n## 3. 多算子/微算子并发策略\n\n### 3.1 MoE Expert FFN：GroupGEMM Tile 调度\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE).md` (score: 8906.1)；`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Group GEMM for MoE Inference.md` (score: 7313.5)\n\n```\nGroupGEMM Tile 调度（标准 vs Comet 重排序）:\n\n# 标准 CUTLASS GroupGEMM 调度:\nfor problem_idx in range(num_experts):\n    m = token_counts[problem_idx]     # 该 expert 的 token 数\n    for tile_m in range(0, m, TILE_M):\n        for tile_k in range(0, K, TILE_K):\n            for tile_n in range(0, N, TILE_N):\n                GEMM_tile(tile_m, tile_n, tile_k)\n\n# Comet 重排序调度（通信-计算重叠优化）:\ntiles_sorted = sort_tiles_by_remote_dependency(\n    all_tiles,\n    key=lambda t: count_remote_tokens(t),  # local tile 优先\n    ascending=True\n)\nfor tile in tiles_sorted:\n    GEMM_tile(tile)\n\n在 Hopper 上的实现细节:\n  - TMA (cp.async.bulk): producer warp 异步加载 global→shared\n  - consumer warp 在 Tensor Core 上执行 MMA\n  - 形成 producer-consumer 软件流水线\n  - Comet 在 tile 调度层注入重排序，不改动流水线本身\n```\n\n**EPS-MoE 的动态 GEMM 选择策略**（笔记证据）:\n\n| 输入 token 数 m | 推荐 GEMM 实现 | 原因 |\n|-----------------|---------------|------|\n| m < 2048 (decode 阶段) | GroupGEMM | 小 batch 时 per-expert launch overhead 占比高，合并为 GroupGEMM 消除 overhead |\n| m ≥ 4096 (prefill 阶段) | DenseGEMM (cuBLAS) | 大 batch 时 GroupGEMM 的 group 管理开销超过收益，cuBLAS 的 dense kernel 效率更高 |\n\n**注解**: GroupGEMM 的 tile 调度核心挑战是不同 expert 的输入 token 数差异巨大（MoE routing 的动态性）。当单个 expert token 数少于 TILE_M 时，需要 padding 或使用更小的 tile；当 token 数远大于 TILE_M 时，可沿 M 维切分为多个 tile。Hopper TMA 的引入使得 GEMM 的 global→shared 数据搬运从 SM 的 ALU 指令中解放（TMA 使用独立的硬件单元），producer warp 只需发起 TMA 请求，后续数据传输由 TMA 硬件完成，consumer warp 可以全时执行 MMA。\n\n---\n\n### 3.2 Tile 级通信-计算融合（Intra-operator Overlap）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels.md` (score: 5519.8)\n\nMegaScale-MoE 实现的四类 tile 级融合 kernel：\n\n```\n类型 1: A2A + GEMM（Attention Output Projection）\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ SM 分配: 少量 SM 处理 A2A 通信管理                    │\n│          其余 SM 全部用于 GEMM 计算                    │\n│                                                      │\n│ 时间线:                                               │\n│ T0: launch_local_GEMM_tiles() + launch_A2A_async()   │\n│ T1: ┌─ SM₀..SMₖ: GEMM(local_tile_0) ──────────┐     │\n│     │  Copy Engine: A2A(remote_tile_0) ────────│     │\n│ T2: └─ device_memory_barrier_poll(remote_ready)┘     │\n│ T3: ┌─ SM₀..SMₖ: GEMM(remote_tile_0) ─────────┐     │\n│     │  Copy Engine: A2A(remote_tile_1) ────────│     │\n│     ...                                              │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n类型 3: AG + Scatter + GroupedGEMM（FFN Token Dispatch）\n  关键优化: 排序使每个 computation tile 依赖尽可能少的 source rank\n  sorted_tokens = sort_by_expert_then_source_rank(input_tokens)\n  → 每个 tile 的理想情况: 仅依赖 1 个 source rank\n  → 减少 device_memory_barrier_poll 等待次数\n```\n\n**注解**: Tile 级融合实现了跨算子的微算子并发——在有数据依赖的算子间（如 A2A dispatch → expert GEMM），将整个工作负载按 tile 切分后，不同 tile 的计算和通信可以流水线化执行。SM 分配策略（通信管理用少量 SM、计算用大量 SM）通过 profiling 调优使通信和计算的延时匹配（通信 latency ≈ 计算 latency），避免一方等待另一方。Swizzling（重排 tile 执行顺序）使各 rank 的 remote data 到达节奏与 GEMM tile 消费节奏对齐，避免多 rank 同时读写导致的 NVLink 带宽争用。\n\n---\n\n### 3.3 Mirage Persistent Kernel (MPK)：SM 级 tGraph 并发调度\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel.../span-idpage-2-0span2.2-Kernel-Fusion.md` (score: 3408.0)\n\nMPK 将 tensor program 编译为 SM 级的 task graph (tGraph)，每个 SM 执行一个 task，通过 device-memory event 同步：\n\n```\ntGraph 结构:\n  Task (蓝/橙矩形): 单 SM 上执行的计算/通信单元\n  Event (绿圆): task 间的同步点\n\n任务调度:\n  1. tGraph 归一化: 每个 task 最多 1 个 dependent event + 1 个 triggering event\n  2. tGraph 线性化 (BFS): 同一 event 触发的 task 在存储中连续\n  3. GPU 内存中的紧凑表示:\n     - Per task: dependent_event_idx, triggering_event_idx\n     - Per event: trigger_count, first_task_idx, last_task_idx\n\n对比 CUDA Graph:\n  CUDA Graph:  kernel 级依赖、stream 同步\n  MPK tGraph:   SM 级依赖、device-memory event 同步\n                → 支持 intra-kernel 跨算子重叠（如 MatMul+AllReduce）\n```\n\n**注解**: MPK 的 tGraph 将并发粒度从 kernel 级提升到 SM 级——传统 CUDA Graph 只能在 kernel 边界表达依赖，而 tGraph 可以在 kernel 内部的 SM task 间表达精确的 producer-consumer 依赖（如 MatMul task 的输出 tile 直接被后续 AllReduce task 消费，无需等待整个 MatMul kernel 完成）。Event fusion（successor-set / predecessor-set）消除冗余同步点，减少 barrier 开销。归一化 + 线性化使依赖存储紧凑且访问模式 cache-friendly。\n\n---\n\n## 4. 不同硬件平台的 Tile 切分策略差异\n\n### 4.1 GPU SM Warp Scheduler 驱动的 Tile 级并发\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/ILP_TLP_Arithmetic Intensity Trade-off in DNN Kernels.md` (score: 1262.8)\n\n```\nGPU SM 微架构对 Tile 并发的驱动:\n\nSM 资源维度:\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Warp Scheduler × 4  (每 cycle 可 issue 1 指令/warp) │\n  │ Dispatch Unit × 4   (每 cycle 可 dispatch 1 warp)   │\n  │ Register File: 256 KB/SM (A100), 256 KB/SM (H100)  │\n  │ Shared Memory/L1: 164 KB/SM (A100), 228 KB/SM (H100)│\n  │ Tensor Core × 4    (A100 3rd gen, H100 4th gen)    │\n  │ Max Threads/SM: 2048                                 │\n  │ Max Blocks/SM: 32                                    │\n  │ Max Warps/SM: 64                                     │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nILP/TLP/Arithmetic Intensity 三维 trade-off:\n  ILP ↑  →  更多 register/thread → TLP ↓ (occupancy 降低)\n           eg: register=128/thread → max warps/SM = 256KB/(128×32×4B) ≈ 16 warps\n               register=64/thread  → max warps/SM = 256KB/(64×32×4B) ≈ 32 warps\n\n  Intensity ↑ → 更大 tile → 更多 SMEM/block → TLP ↓\n           eg: SMEM=144KB/block → max blocks/SM = floor(164KB/144KB) = 1\n               SMEM=48KB/block  → max blocks/SM = floor(164KB/48KB) = 3\n\n  Infera 配置空间: 3 种 register × 4 种 SMEM × 3 种 pipeline = 36 种基础配置\n```\n\n**注解**: GPU SM 的 warp scheduler 通过零开销的 warp 切换隐藏延迟——当当前 warp stall（等待 global memory load 或 Tensor Core MMA 结果）时，scheduler 在下一个 cycle 立即切换到另一个就绪 warp。因此，SM occupancy（active warps/SM）越高，延迟隐藏能力越强。但 occupancy 与 register per thread 和 SMEM per block 形成零和博弈——更高的 ILP（更多 register）或更大的 tile（更多 SMEM）都会降低 occupancy。对于多算子/微算子并发场景，kernel 设计需要在 register tiling、shared memory tiling、warp-level parallelism 间找到平衡点——Infera 的 36 种配置覆盖三维 trade-off 空间并通过 online regression model 选择最优配置。\n\n---\n\n### 4.2 NPU 达芬奇架构 Tile 约束\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend 910A NPU.md`\n\n```\nAscend 910A 达芬奇架构（基于笔记）:\n  - 32 AI Core / 芯片\n  - FP16: 320 TFLOPS, INT8: 640 TOPS\n  - HBM 带宽: 1.07 TB/s\n  - 片上互联: Mesh NoC, 256 GB/s 带宽\n\nCANN 软件栈层次:\n  1. MindSpore / PyTorch (框架层)\n  2. CANN GE Engine (图编译和优化)\n  3. CANN Runtime + Driver (内存管理、AI Core/Vector Core 调度)\n  4. Ascend 910A 硬件\n\n关键硬件组件:\n  - Cube Unit: 矩阵乘法加速单元（类似 Tensor Core），用于 GEMM 计算\n  - Vector Unit: 向量计算单元，用于 activation/normalization/element-wise\n  - Scalar Unit: 标量计算单元，用于控制流和地址计算\n  - MTE (Memory Transfer Engine): 专用数据传输引擎，支持远程内存直接访问\n```\n\n**注解**: 笔记详细描述了 Ascend 910A 的宏观架构和 CANN 软件栈，但未提供 Cube Unit 的具体矩阵乘 tile 尺寸约束（如 GPU Tensor Core 的 16×16×16）。达芬奇架构的三单元分离设计（Cube/Vector/Scalar）天然支持多算子并发——GEMM 在 Cube Unit 上执行的同时，activation 在 Vector Unit 上执行，地址计算在 Scalar Unit 上执行，形成硬件级的指令并行。MTE 的远程内存访问能力（CoC 策略）使数据搬运与计算完全重叠（MTE 不占用 AI Core 计算资源）。但具体的 tile size 与 Cube Unit 尺寸的映射关系、Vector Unit 的向量化宽度（如 256-bit SIMD？）等细节，笔记未明确说明。\n\n---\n\n### 4.3 TPU MXU Systolic Array Tile 约束\n\n**笔记证据**: vault 中无 TPU v5e/v5p 的详细笔记。以下为可推断补充。\n\nTPU 的 MXU（Matrix Multiply Unit）是 128×128 或 128×256 的脉动阵列（systolic array），其 tile 约束与 GPU 有本质区别：\n\n```\nTPU MXU 对 Tile 形状的限制（可推断）:\n\n  MXU 尺寸:\n    TPU v3:     128×128 systolic array (BF16)\n    TPU v4:     128×128 (BF16/INT8)\n    TPU v5e/v5p: 128×128 或 128×256 (支持 FP8/INT8)\n\n  与 GPU 的本质差异:\n    GPU Tensor Core:  warp 级 MMA fragment (16×16×16) → 灵活的 tile 组合\n    TPU MXU:          chip 级 systolic array (128×128) → 严格的 tile shape 约束\n\n  Tile 对齐要求:\n    - 矩阵乘的 K 维必须对齐 MXU 的 input dimension (128)\n    - 矩阵乘的 N 维受 MXU output dimension (128/256) 约束\n    - 非对齐 → 必须 padding，浪费计算和带宽\n    - 小 tile（如 MoE expert token 少 → M 维小）→ MXU 利用率低（大量 PE 空闲）\n```\n\n**注解**: TPU 的 systolic array 与 GPU Tensor Core 的关键区别在于粒度——TPU MXU 是整个芯片级的固定尺寸脉动阵列，而 GPU Tensor Core 是 SM 内的可组合单元（多个 warp 可独立使用不同的 Tensor Core）。这意味着：(1) TPU 上 tile size 必须被 128/128×128 整除或至少对齐，否则利用率急剧下降；(2) MoE 的小 expert（token 少）场景下 TPU MXU 利用率必然低于 GPU（GPU 可以通过更多 warp 填充不同 expert 的 tile）；(3) TPU 的 tile 调度由 XLA 编译器在编译时静态确定，不支持 persistent kernel 的运行时动态调度。但笔记未提供 TPU 上 MoE/DiT 的具体 tile 调度实验数据。\n\n---\n\n### 4.4 Groq LPU TSP、AMD MI300X CDNA3\n\n**笔记证据**: vault 中无相关笔记。以下为简要可推断描述。\n\n- **Groq LPU (Tensor Streaming Processor)**：确定性架构，无 cache、无 shared memory、无动态调度——编译器在编译时静态确定所有数据移动和指令时序。Tile 切分由编译器在 compile time 完全确定，无运行时 tile 调度。笔记未提供 Groq 上 MoE/DiT kernel 的具体实现数据。\n\n- **AMD MI300X (CDNA3)**：使用 wavefront（64 线程，vs NVIDIA warp 32 线程）调度。CDNA3 的 Matrix Core 类似 NVIDIA Tensor Core 但 fragment size 和精度支持不同。ROCm/HIP 生态中的 tile 切分策略与 CUDA 概念相似（通过 composable_kernel 或类似 CUTLASS 的模板库）。笔记未提供 MI300X 上 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video kernel 的具体 tile 调度数据。\n\n---\n\n## 5. 指令流水线视角：Tile 计算的时序编排\n\n### 5.1 GPU GEMM Kernel 的 Software Pipelining 时序\n\n```\nGEMM Tile 计算的指令流水线时序（Hopper + TMA）:\n时间 →\n\nProducer Warp (TMA async copy):  Consumer Warp (MMA compute):\nT0:  cp.async.bulk K₀: global→SMEM   │\nT1:  cp.async.bulk K₁: global→SMEM   │  (等待 K₀ 完成)\nT2:  cp.async.bulk K₂: global→SMEM   │  mma.sync K₀: SMEM→RF→Acc\nT3:  cp.async.bulk K₃: global→SMEM   │  mma.sync K₀ (continued)\nT4:  cp.async.bulk K₀': global→SMEM  │  mma.sync K₁: SMEM→RF→Acc\n     (下一 tile 的 K₀)                │\nT5:  cp.async.bulk K₁': global→SMEM  │  mma.sync K₁ (continued)\n...\n\nPipeline depth: 2 stages (load | compute)\nOverlap: TMA load 与 MMA compute 完全并发\n         (TMA 使用独立硬件单元，不占用 SM 的 warp scheduler/ALU/Tensor Core)\n```\n\n**注解**: Hopper TMA（Tensor Memory Accelerator）是 GPU 上一个重要的硬件创新——它将 global→shared memory 的数据搬运从 SM 的计算流水线中分离出来。TMA 执行 `cp.async.bulk` 时，SM 的 warp scheduler 可以调度 consumer warp 执行 MMA 指令，实现了 load 和 compute 的完全重叠。在 Ampere 架构上，相同功能需要 SM 的 load/store 单元执行 `cp.async`（shared memory copy），仍消耗 SM 的部分资源。这解释了为什么 HyTiS 在 Hopper 上使用 persistent kernel + TMA 而在 Ampere 上不用——Ampere 缺少硬件 TMA 支持导致 persistent kernel 的 register 压力过大。\n\n---\n\n## 6. 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | Tile 配置 | 硬件平台 | 并发支持 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|-----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **CUTLASS** | 层次化 tile 分解 (Thread→Warp→CTA→Kernel) | MMA 16×16×16, WarpShape 64×64, CTA 128×128 | NVIDIA GPU (Volta→Blackwell) | warp-level MMA + shared memory tile 共享 | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CUDA CUTLASS.md (6976.0) |\n| **FlashMoE** | Single persistent kernel + actor model | tile (128,64), block=128, reg=255, 2 blocks/SM | H100/A100 (NVLink + NVSHMEM) | Processor/Scheduler/Subscriber actor 并发 | Megakernel note (4211.2) + FlashMoE paper (1347.6) |\n| **FlashAttention** | SRAM-bounded tiling + online softmax | B_c=384, B_r=64 (A100, d=64) | A100/H100 | outer/inner loop tile pipeline | Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel note |\n| **WELDER** | 硬件对齐 tile shape 搜索 (3 penalties) | 自动搜索, MMA 整除约束 | V100 (SM 约束) | 多 operator 图级 tile 调度 | Hardware-Aligned Tile Search note (2897.4) |\n| **HyTiS** | Tile layout scheduling (GM/GN) + wave utilization | 动态 group-M/N 选择 | H100 (persistent+TMA) / A100 (传统) | wave-level tile 并发 | HyTiS paper (2988.0) |\n| **MegaScale-MoE** | 4 类 tile 级 fused kernel (A2A+GEMM 等) | tile 大小与通信粒度对齐 | NVIDIA GPU (NCCL + NVLink) | SM 分区 + device memory barrier tile 同步 | Intra-operator Overlap note (5519.8) |\n| **MPK (Mirage)** | SM 级 tGraph 自动编译 | 按 SM 数和数据依赖自动分区 | NVIDIA GPU | SM-task 级跨算子并发 (MatMul+AllReduce) | MPK paper (3408.0) |\n| **GroupGEMM** | 多 expert GEMM 批量执行 | TILE_M/N/K 由 CUTLASS 确定 | H100 (TMA) / A100 (cp.async) | expert 间 tile 交错调度 | GroupGEMM note (8906.1) |\n| **Ascend CANN/TBE** | Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元分离 | 笔记未明确 Cube Unit tile 尺寸 | Ascend 910A/910B/310P | Cube+Vector+Scalar 硬件并发 + MTE 数据搬运 | Ascend 910A note + CANN note |\n| **TPU XLA** | 128×128/128×256 MXU systolic array | 严格对齐 128 的倍数 | TPU v3/v4/v5e/v5p | 编译时静态调度 | vault 无详细笔记 (可推断) |\n| **Groq Compiler** | 确定性编译时调度 (无 cache/SMEM) | 编译时完全确定 | Groq LPU (TSP) | 确定性指令级编排 | vault 无详细笔记 |\n| **AMD MI300X ROCm** | CDNA3 Matrix Core + wavefront (64) | 类似 CUTLASS 的模板库 (composable_kernel) | MI300X (CDNA3) | wavefront-level 并发 | vault 无详细笔记 |\n\n---\n\n## 7. 不确定性\n\n1. **TPU v5e/v5p MXU tile 约束**：vault 中无 TPU 脉动阵列的详细笔记，128×128/128×256 尺寸和 tile 对齐要求为可推断（基于 TPU 公开文档）。\n2. **Groq LPU TSP**：vault 中无 Groq 架构笔记，确定性编译时调度描述为可推断。\n3. **AMD MI300X CDNA3**：vault 中无 AMD GPU 的 tile 切分笔记。\n4. **NPU Cube Unit tile 尺寸**：笔记描述了 Cube/Vector/Scalar 三单元分离架构，但未提供 Cube Unit 的具体矩阵乘 tile 约束（如 GPU MMA 的 16×16×16）。\n5. **DiT / 多模态 / Video kernel 具体 tile 参数**：vault 笔记主要集中在 MoE 和通用 GPU attention kernel 的 tiling（FlashAttention、FlashMoE、GroupGEMM），缺少 DiT diffusion denoising kernel（attention+MLP 子 kernel）、多模态 cross-attention fusion kernel、Video spatial-temporal + 3D conv kernel 的特定 tile 切分参数和调度策略的详细笔记。\n6. **Grid-stride loop 与 Cooperative Groups**：vault 中未找到详细实现笔记，仅可推断标准 CUDA 编程范式。\n7. **Dynamic Parallelism 的 MoE 场景实验数据**：笔记仅提及 CDP 概念，无基于 MoE/DiT 场景的具体 benchmark 数据。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L4-Q4.1\n","userModified":false}}
